window.BUZZ_COURSE_V2_LESSONS = Object.assign(window.BUZZ_COURSE_V2_LESSONS || {}, {"derivative-power-rules":{"id":"derivative-power-rules","prerequisites":["derivative-from-definition"],"next":["derivative-trig"],"related":["product-rule","quotient-rule","logarithmic-differentiation","limit-laws-direct"],"objectives":["用冪次法則 $(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$ 微分任何次方，包括負數與分數次方","用常數倍與加減的規則，一項一項微分多項式","先把 $\\frac1{x^3}$、$\\sqrt x$、$\\frac{x^2+1}{x}$ 改寫成次方的和，再微分","用二項式展開證明正整數次方的冪次法則"],"concept":[{"heading":"① 常數與 $x$","body":["上一課：每次都用定義","這一課：找出規則，以後直接套","常數 $f(x)=c$：差商的分子 $c-c=0$","圖形是水平線，到處的斜率都是 $0$","$f(x)=x$：","直覺：導數是斜率，直線的斜率到處一樣"],"tex":["f'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}","\\frac{d}{dx}\\,c=0","\\frac{(x+h)-x}{h}=\\frac hh=1","\\frac{d}{dx}\\,x=1"]},{"heading":"② 冪次法則","body":["用定義算過的幾個：","看出規律：次方掉下來當係數，次方減 1","對任何實數 $n$ 都成立（$x$ 在定義域內）；正整數的證明在 ⑤，一般的 $n$ 留到「對數微分法」","例：","也可以用上一課「有理化」的方法直接驗證 $(\\sqrt x)'=\\frac1{2\\sqrt x}$"],"tex":["\\frac{d}{dx}x^2=2x,\\qquad \\frac{d}{dx}x^3=3x^2","\\frac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}","\\frac{d}{dx}x^{7}=7x^{6},\\qquad\\frac{d}{dx}x^{-1}=-x^{-2}","\\frac{d}{dx}x^{1/2}=\\frac12x^{-1/2}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x}"]},{"heading":"② 試一題","body":["求出 $\\dfrac23x^{-1/3}$，再代 $x=8$：$8^{-1/3}=\\dfrac12$"]},{"heading":"③ 線性：常數倍與加減","body":["為什麼？寫出差商：","常數倍一樣：$\\frac{cf(x+h)-cf(x)}{h}=c\\cdot\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}$","兩塊的極限都存在，用極限的加法定律：$\\to f'(x)+g'(x)$","例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\big(x^5-3x^2+7\\big)$","一項一項微：","例：$x=1$ 的切線斜率 $=5-6=-1$","多項式：每一項都只用冪次法則"],"tex":["\\big(c\\,f(x)\\big)'=c\\,f'(x)","\\big(f(x)\\pm g(x)\\big)'=f'(x)\\pm g'(x)","\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{(f+g)(x+h)-(f+g)(x)}{h}\\\\&=\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}+\\frac{g(x+h)-g(x)}{h}\\end{aligned}","=5x^4-3\\cdot2x+0","=5x^4-6x"]},{"heading":"③ 小心：沒有「乘法版」","body":["反例：$x\\cdot x=x^2$，導數是 $2x$","若把兩個 $x$ 各自微：$1\\cdot1=1\\ne2x$","乘、除的規則在下一個單元（乘法法則、除法法則）"],"tex":["\\big(f\\cdot g\\big)'\\ne f'\\cdot g'"]},{"heading":"④ 先改寫成次方","body":["看到分式、根號：先改寫成 $x^n$ 的和","例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\Big(\\dfrac{2}{x^3}+4\\sqrt x\\Big)$","改寫：$2x^{-3}+4x^{1/2}$","常見錯誤：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\dfrac{2}{x^3}\\ne\\dfrac{2}{3x^2}$"],"tex":["\\frac1{x^n}=x^{-n},\\qquad\\sqrt[m]{x^k}=x^{k/m}","\\frac{d}{dx}=2(-3)x^{-4}+4\\cdot\\frac12x^{-1/2}","=-\\frac{6}{x^4}+\\frac{2}{\\sqrt x}"]},{"heading":"④ 先約分，再求切線","body":["$f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2+1}{x}$，求 $f'(2)$","分子每一項除以 $x$：","切點：$f(2)=\\dfrac{4+1}{2}=\\dfrac52$"],"tex":["f(x)=\\frac{x^2}{x}+\\frac1x=x+x^{-1}","f'(x)=1-x^{-2}=1-\\frac1{x^2}","f'(2)=1-\\frac14=\\frac34","y-\\frac52=\\frac34(x-2)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\frac34x+1"]},{"heading":"⑤ 證明（正整數 $n$）","body":["要證：$n$ 是正整數時，$\\dfrac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}$","二項式展開：","相減，$x^n$ 消掉：","除以 $h$（$h\\ne0$）：","$h\\to0$：後面每一項都 $\\to0$","項數是固定的 $n$ 項，所以可以逐項取極限","負整數、分數次方：之後用除法法則、隱函數微分補證"],"tex":["\\begin{aligned}(x+h)^n=\\;&x^n+nx^{n-1}h\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h^2+\\cdots+h^n\\end{aligned}","\\begin{aligned}(x+h)^n-x^n=\\;&nx^{n-1}h\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h^2+\\cdots+h^n\\end{aligned}","\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x+h)^n-x^n}{h}=\\;&nx^{n-1}\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h+\\cdots+h^{n-1}\\end{aligned}","\\frac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}\\qquad\\blacksquare"]},{"heading":"重點整理","body":["• $(c)'=0$，$(x)'=1$","• 冪次法則：$(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$，負數、分數次方都能用","• 線性：常數倍提出來，加減逐項微","• 乘法不能逐項微：$(fg)'\\ne f'g'$","• 分式、根號：先改寫成次方，再微","• 證明：二項式展開，帶 $h$ 的項都消失","下一課：三角函數微分"]}],"workedExamples":[{"title":"多項式逐項微分","prompt":"$\\frac{d}{dx} (x^5 - 3x^2 + 7)$","problemId":"der-001","steps":["加減逐項：$x^5$、$-3x^2$、7 各自微分。","$(x^5)' = 5x^4$。","$(-3x^2)' = -3 \\cdot 2x = -6x$（常數倍留著）。","$(7)' = 0$。合起來 $5x^4 - 6x$。"],"answer":"$5x^4 - 6x$"},{"title":"負次方與分數次方","prompt":"$\\frac{d}{dx} (\\frac{2}{x^3} + 4\\sqrt{x})$","steps":["改寫：$\\frac{2}{x^3} = 2x^{-3}$，$4\\sqrt{x} = 4x^{1/2}$。","$(2x^{-3})' = 2 \\cdot (-3)x^{-4} = -6x^{-4}$。次方是 $-3 - 1 = -4$，不是 $-2$。","$(4x^{1/2})' = 4 \\cdot \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)x^{-1/2} = 2x^{-1/2}$。","寫回分式：$-\\frac{6}{x^4} + \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}$（$x > 0$）。"],"answer":"$-\\frac{6}{x^4} + \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}$"},{"title":"先約分，再求切線斜率","prompt":"$f(x) = \\frac{x^2 + 1}{x}$，求 $f'(2)$。","steps":["分子分母不能各自微分。先拆開：$\\frac{x^2 + 1}{x} = x + \\frac{1}{x} = x + x^{-1}$。","$f'(x) = 1 + (-1)x^{-2} = 1 - \\frac{1}{x^2}$。","$f'(2) = 1 - \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{3}{4}$。"],"answer":"$\\frac{3}{4}$"}],"pitfalls":["$\\left(\\frac{1}{x^3}\\right)'$ 寫成 $\\frac{1}{3x^2}$：要先改成 $x^{-3}$，得 $-3x^{-4}$。","負次方減 1 往錯的方向：$x^{-3}$ 的次方減 1 是 $-4$。","常數的導數寫成常數本身，例如 $(7)' = 7$、$(\\pi^2)' = 2\\pi$。","分式的分子分母各自微分：$\\left(\\frac{x^2 + 1}{x}\\right)'$ 寫成 $\\frac{2x}{1}$。","$\\sqrt{x}$ 微分成 $\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{2}$ 或 $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}$，漏了 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 或次方減 1。"],"voice":"fb698d92","sections":[{"title":"常數與 $x$","beats":[{"show":["上一課：每次都用定義","$f'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}$"],"say":"上一課，每次求導數都要回到定義，算一個極限，太累了。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"上一課：每次都用定義"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle f'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}$","on":"定義"}],"t":[4040,10730]},{"show":["這一課：找出規則，以後直接套"],"say":"這一課要找出幾條規則，以後直接套用。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"這一課：找出規則，以後直接套"}],"t":[10730,17270]},{"show":["常數 $f(x)=c$：差商的分子 $c-c=0$","$\\frac{d}{dx}\\,c=0$"],"say":"先看常數函數。x 加 h 代進去還是 c，相減是 0，所以導數是 0。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"常數 $f(x)=c$：差商的分子 $c-c=0$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx1:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}\\,c=0}}$","color":"red","on":"代進"},{"do":"box","term":"bx1","color":"red","on":"相減"},{"do":"write","line":"　圖形是水平線，到處的斜率都是 $0$","color":"violet","on":"所以"}],"t":[17270,27370]},{"show":["$f(x)=x$：","$\\frac{(x+h)-x}{h}=\\frac hh=1$"],"say":"再看 f of x 等於 x：x 加 h 減 x 是 h，除以 h 剛好是 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$f(x)=x$："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{(x+h)-x}{h}=\\frac hh=1$","on":"除以"}],"t":[27370,35770]},{"show":["$\\frac{d}{dx}\\,x=1$"],"say":"所以 x 的導數是 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx2:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}\\,x=1}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx2","color":"red","on":"導數"}],"t":[35770,38790]},{"show":["直覺：導數是斜率，直線的斜率到處一樣"],"say":"其實不用算也知道：導數是切線斜率，直線的切線就是它自己，斜率到處一樣。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"直覺：導數是斜率，直線的斜率到處一樣"}],"t":[38790,49710]}]},{"title":"冪次法則","beats":[{"show":["用定義算過的幾個：","$\\frac{d}{dx}x^2=2x,\\qquad \\frac{d}{dx}x^3=3x^2$"],"say":"上一課算過：x 平方的導數是 2x，x 的三次方的導數是 3 x 平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"用定義算過的幾個："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}x^2=2x,\\qquad \\frac{d}{dx}x^3=3x^2$","on":"的三"}],"t":[49710,57310]},{"show":["看出規律：次方掉下來當係數，次方減 1"],"say":"規律是：次方掉到前面當係數，然後次方減 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"看出規律：次方掉下來當係數，次方減 1"}],"t":[57310,63200]},{"show":["$\\frac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}$"],"say":"這就是冪次法則：x 的 n 次方，導數是 n 乘 x 的 n 減 1 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx3:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx3","color":"red","on":"次方#1"},{"do":"write","line":"　對任何實數 $n$ 都成立（$x$ 在定義域內）；正整數的證明在 ⑤，一般的 $n$ 留到「對數微分法」","color":"violet","on":"次方#2"}],"t":[63200,73050]},{"show":["例：","$\\frac{d}{dx}x^{7}=7x^{6},\\qquad\\frac{d}{dx}x^{-1}=-x^{-2}$"],"say":"例如 x 的 7 次方，導數是 7 x 的 6 次方。負次方也行：x 的負 1 次方，導數是負 x 的負 2 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}x^{7}=7x^{6},\\qquad\\frac{d}{dx}x^{-1}=-x^{-2}$","on":"方也"}],"t":[73050,85050]},{"show":["$\\frac{d}{dx}x^{1/2}=\\frac12x^{-1/2}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x}$"],"say":"分數次方也行：根號 x 是 x 的 2 分之 1 次方，導數是 2 根號 x 分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}x^{1/2}=\\frac12x^{-1/2}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x}$"},{"do":"write","line":"　也可以用上一課「有理化」的方法直接驗證 $(\\sqrt x)'=\\frac1{2\\sqrt x}$","color":"violet","on":"次方#2"}],"t":[85050,94250]},{"show":["斜率 = 2a：左邊負、右邊正"],"say":"圖上看 x 平方：切點往右移，","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"tan","window":[-2.5,2.5,-1,5],"fn":[{"expr":"x^2","label":"y = x²"},{"expr":"2*a*(x-a)+a^2","color":"red","dash":true,"label":"切線"}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"a^2","label":"P","color":"blue"}],"params":{"a":{"min":-2,"max":2,"value":-1.5,"label":"切點 a"}},"readout":"切線斜率 = {2*a}","height":260}}},{"do":"write","line":"切線斜率 = −3","on":"平方"},{"do":"write","line":"斜率 = 2a：左邊負、右邊正","color":"violet","on":"點往"}],"t":[94250,98440]},{"show":["冪次法則"],"say":"斜率 2a 從負的變成正的，在 0 剛好是 0。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"tan","window":[-2.5,2.5,-1,5],"fn":[{"expr":"x^2","label":"y = x²"},{"expr":"2*a*(x-a)+a^2","color":"red","dash":true,"label":"切線"}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"a^2","label":"P","color":"blue"}],"params":{"a":{"min":-2,"max":2,"value":-1.5,"label":"切點 a"}},"readout":"切線斜率 = {2*a}","height":260},"vals":{"a":1.5}}},{"do":"write","line":"切線斜率 = 3","on":"剛好"}],"t":[98440,104340]}]},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\,x^{-3}=$？"],"say":"試一題：x 的負 3 次方。注意，次方減 1 是往更負的方向走。","t":[104340,113390]}],"check":0},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$x^{2/3}$ 在 $x=8$ 的切線斜率是？"],"say":"再猜猜看：x 的 3 分之 2 次方，在 8 的斜率是多少？","t":[113390,121200]}],"predict":{"ask":"$x^{2/3}$ 在 $x=8$ 的切線斜率是？","options":[{"label":"$\\dfrac13$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\dfrac23$","why":"還要乘 $x^{-1/3}=8^{-1/3}=\\frac12$"},{"label":"$\\dfrac{16}{3}$","why":"次方應該減 $1$ 變成 $-\\frac13$，不是加 $1$ 變成 $\\frac53$"},{"label":"$4$","why":"這是 $8^{2/3}$，函數值，不是斜率"}]}},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["求出 $\\dfrac23x^{-1/3}$，再代 $x=8$：$8^{-1/3}=\\dfrac12$"],"say":"導數是 3 分之 2 乘 x 的負 3 分之 1 次方，代 8 得 2 分之 1，斜率是 3 分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"求出 $\\dfrac23x^{-1/3}$，再代 $x=8$：$8^{-1/3}=\\dfrac12$"}],"t":[121200,135330]}]},{"title":"線性：常數倍與加減","beats":[{"show":["$\\big(c\\,f(x)\\big)'=c\\,f'(x)$","$\\big(f(x)\\pm g(x)\\big)'=f'(x)\\pm g'(x)$"],"say":"再來兩條規則：常數倍可以提出來；加減的導數，就是導數的加減。合起來叫做線性。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\big(c\\,f(x)\\big)'=c\\,f'(x)$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx4:\\displaystyle \\big(f(x)\\pm g(x)\\big)'=f'(x)\\pm g'(x)}}$","color":"red","on":"提出"},{"do":"box","term":"bx4","color":"red","on":"數的"}],"t":[135330,146290]},{"show":["為什麼？寫出差商：","$\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{(f+g)(x+h)-(f+g)(x)}{h}\\\\&=\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}+\\frac{g(x+h)-g(x)}{h}\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"為什麼？f 加 g 的差商，重新分組，剛好是 f 的差商加 g 的差商。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"為什麼？寫出差商："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{(f+g)(x+h)-(f+g)(x)}{h}\\\\&=\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}+\\frac{g(x+h)-g(x)}{h}\\end{aligned}}$","on":"重新"},{"do":"write","line":"　常數倍一樣：$\\frac{cf(x+h)-cf(x)}{h}=c\\cdot\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}$","color":"violet","on":"的差#2"}],"t":[146290,154170]},{"show":["兩塊的極限都存在，用極限的加法定律：$\\to f'(x)+g'(x)$"],"say":"兩塊的極限都存在，用極限的加法定律，就得到 f prime 加 g prime。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"兩塊的極限都存在，用極限的加法定律：$\\to f'(x)+g'(x)$"}],"t":[154170,163270]},{"show":["例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\big(x^5-3x^2+7\\big)$"],"say":"例子：x 的 5 次方，減 3 x 平方，加 7。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\big(x^5-3x^2+7\\big)$"}],"t":[163270,169860]},{"show":["一項一項微：","$=5x^4-3\\cdot2x+0$"],"say":"一項一項來：x 的 5 次方變 5 x 的 4 次方；3 留著，x 平方變 2x；常數 7 變 0。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"一項一項微："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle =5x^4-3\\cdot2x+0$","on":"留著"}],"t":[169860,180260]},{"show":["$=5x^4-6x$"],"say":"答案是 5 x 的 4 次方減 6x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx5:\\displaystyle =5x^4-6x}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx5","color":"red","on":"次方"},{"do":"write","line":"　例：$x=1$ 的切線斜率 $=5-6=-1$","color":"violet","on":"方減"},{"do":"write","line":"多項式：每一項都只用冪次法則","on":"6x"}],"t":[180260,186730]}]},{"title":"小心：沒有「乘法版」","beats":[{"show":["$\\big(f\\cdot g\\big)'\\ne f'\\cdot g'$"],"say":"要小心：乘法不能拆開。f 乘 g 的導數，不等於 f prime 乘 g prime。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx6:\\displaystyle \\big(f\\cdot g\\big)'\\ne f'\\cdot g'}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx6","color":"red","on":"不等"}],"t":[186730,197240]},{"show":["反例：$x\\cdot x=x^2$，導數是 $2x$","若把兩個 $x$ 各自微：$1\\cdot1=1\\ne2x$"],"say":"反例：x 乘 x 是 x 平方，導數是 2x；但兩個 x 各自微分再相乘，是 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"反例：$x\\cdot x=x^2$，導數是 $2x$"},{"do":"write","line":"若把兩個 $x$ 各自微：$1\\cdot1=1\\ne2x$","on":"平方"},{"do":"write","line":"　乘、除的規則在下一個單元（乘法法則、除法法則）","color":"violet","on":"各自"}],"t":[197240,206540]}],"check":1},{"title":"先改寫成次方","beats":[{"show":["看到分式、根號：先改寫成 $x^n$ 的和"],"say":"冪次法則只認得 x 的 n 次方。遇到分式、根號，先改寫成次方的和。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"看到分式、根號：先改寫成 $x^n$ 的和"}],"t":[215330,223570]},{"show":["$\\frac1{x^n}=x^{-n},\\qquad\\sqrt[m]{x^k}=x^{k/m}$"],"say":"x 的 n 次方分之一，是 x 的負 n 次方；m 次方根號 x 的 k 次方，是 x 的 m 分之 k 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx7:\\displaystyle \\frac1{x^n}=x^{-n},\\qquad\\sqrt[m]{x^k}=x^{k/m}}}$"},{"do":"box","term":"bx7","on":"根號"}],"t":[223570,236440]},{"show":["例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\Big(\\dfrac{2}{x^3}+4\\sqrt x\\Big)$","改寫：$2x^{-3}+4x^{1/2}$"],"say":"例子：x 的三次方分之 2，加 4 倍根號 x。先改寫成 2 乘 x 的負 3 次方，加 4 乘 x 的 2 分之 1 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\Big(\\dfrac{2}{x^3}+4\\sqrt x\\Big)$"},{"do":"write","line":"改寫：$2x^{-3}+4x^{1/2}$","on":"的負"}],"t":[236440,250140]},{"show":["$\\frac{d}{dx}=2(-3)x^{-4}+4\\cdot\\frac12x^{-1/2}$"],"say":"一項一項微：2 乘負 3，x 的負 4 次方；4 乘 2 分之 1，x 的負 2 分之 1 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}=2(-3)x^{-4}+4\\cdot\\frac12x^{-1/2}$"}],"t":[250140,260340]},{"show":["$=-\\frac{6}{x^4}+\\frac{2}{\\sqrt x}$"],"say":"寫回分式：負的 x 的 4 次方分之 6，加根號 x 分之 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx8:\\displaystyle =-\\frac{6}{x^4}+\\frac{2}{\\sqrt x}}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx8","color":"red","on":"分之#1"}],"t":[260340,267140]},{"show":["常見錯誤：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\dfrac{2}{x^3}\\ne\\dfrac{2}{3x^2}$"],"say":"常見的錯誤是把分母直接微分。分母不能自己微，一定要先改寫成負次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"常見錯誤：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\dfrac{2}{x^3}\\ne\\dfrac{2}{3x^2}$","color":"red"}],"t":[267140,276230]}]},{"title":"先約分，再求切線","beats":[{"show":["$f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2+1}{x}$，求 $f'(2)$"],"say":"再一個例子：f of x 等於 x 分之 x 平方加 1，求 f prime 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2+1}{x}$，求 $f'(2)$"}],"t":[276230,286100]},{"show":["分子每一項除以 $x$：","$f(x)=\\frac{x^2}{x}+\\frac1x=x+x^{-1}$"],"say":"先把分子每一項除以 x：變成 x 加 x 的負 1 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"分子每一項除以 $x$："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle f(x)=\\frac{x^2}{x}+\\frac1x=x+x^{-1}$","on":"的負"}],"t":[286100,292300]},{"show":["$f'(x)=1-x^{-2}=1-\\frac1{x^2}$"],"say":"微分：1 減 x 的負 2 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle f'(x)=1-x^{-2}=1-\\frac1{x^2}$"}],"t":[292300,296100]},{"show":["$f'(2)=1-\\frac14=\\frac34$"],"say":"代 2 進去，得 4 分之 3。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx9:\\displaystyle f'(2)=1-\\frac14=\\frac34}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx9","color":"red","on":"分之"}],"t":[296100,301790]},{"show":["切點：$f(2)=\\dfrac{4+1}{2}=\\dfrac52$","$y-\\frac52=\\frac34(x-2)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\frac34x+1$"],"say":"順便求切線：切點是 2 逗號 2 分之 5，用點斜式整理得 y 等於 4 分之 3 x 加 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"切點：$f(2)=\\dfrac{4+1}{2}=\\dfrac52$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx10:\\displaystyle y-\\frac52=\\frac34(x-2)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\frac34x+1}}$","on":"逗號"},{"do":"box","term":"bx10","on":"用點"},{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"rat","window":[0,5,0,6],"fn":[{"expr":"x+1/x","color":"blue","label":"y = (x²+1)/x"},{"expr":"0.75*x+1","color":"red","dash":true,"label":"切線"}],"points":[{"x":2,"y":2.5,"label":"(2, 5/2)","color":"red"}],"height":230}},"on":"等於"},{"do":"write","line":"在 x = 2 的切線斜率是 3/4","color":"violet","on":"1。"}],"t":[301790,314290]}]},{"title":"排排看","beats":[{"show":["微分 $\\dfrac{x^2+1}{x}$ 這類式子的步驟"],"say":"把剛才的步驟排一排。","t":[314290,325440]}],"proof":true,"order":{"ask":"微分 $\\dfrac{x^2+1}{x}$ 這類式子的步驟","steps":[{"label":"把分式拆開、根號寫成分數次方，改寫成 $x^n$ 的和"},{"label":"每一項用冪次法則：次方掉下來，次方減 $1$","why":"先要有上一步：把分式拆開、根號寫成分數次方，改寫成 $x^n$ 的和"},{"label":"常數倍留著，常數項變 $0$","why":"先要有上一步：每一項用冪次法則：次方掉下來，次方減 $1$"},{"label":"需要的話整理回分式或根號，再代值","why":"先要有上一步：常數倍留著，常數項變 $0$"}]}},{"title":"排排看","beats":[{"show":["$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\,\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt x}=$？"],"say":"試一題：根號 x 分之一。","t":[325440,334120]}],"check":2},{"title":"證明（正整數 $n$）","beats":[{"show":["要證：$n$ 是正整數時，$\\dfrac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}$"],"say":"最後，證明正整數次方的冪次法則。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"要證：$n$ 是正整數時，$\\dfrac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}$"}],"t":[334120,340060]},{"show":["二項式展開：","$\\begin{aligned}(x+h)^n=\\;&x^n+nx^{n-1}h\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h^2+\\cdots+h^n\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"用二項式定理展開 x 加 h 的 n 次方：第一項是 x 的 n 次方，第二項是 n x 的 n 減 1 次方乘 h，後面每一項至少有 h 平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"二項式展開："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}(x+h)^n=\\;&x^n+nx^{n-1}h\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h^2+\\cdots+h^n\\end{aligned}}$","on":"第二"}],"t":[340060,356230]},{"show":["相減，$x^n$ 消掉：","$\\begin{aligned}(x+h)^n-x^n=\\;&nx^{n-1}h\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h^2+\\cdots+h^n\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"減掉 x 的 n 次方，第一項消掉，剩下每一項都至少有一個 h。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"相減，$x^n$ 消掉："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}(x+h)^n-x^n=\\;&nx^{n-1}h\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h^2+\\cdots+h^n\\end{aligned}}$","on":"剩下"}],"t":[356230,364970]},{"show":["除以 $h$（$h\\ne0$）：","$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x+h)^n-x^n}{h}=\\;&nx^{n-1}\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h+\\cdots+h^{n-1}\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"除以 h：第一項剩 n x 的 n 減 1 次方；後面每一項還帶著 h。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"除以 $h$（$h\\ne0$）："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x+h)^n-x^n}{h}=\\;&nx^{n-1}\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h+\\cdots+h^{n-1}\\end{aligned}}$","on":"次方"}],"t":[364970,374020]},{"show":["$h\\to0$：後面每一項都 $\\to0$","$\\frac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}\\qquad\\blacksquare$"],"say":"h 趨近 0，帶 h 的項都趨近 0，只留下第一項。冪次法則證完了。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$h\\to0$：後面每一項都 $\\to0$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx11:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}\\qquad\\blacksquare}}$","color":"red","on":"的項"},{"do":"box","term":"bx11","color":"red","on":"只留"},{"do":"write","line":"　項數是固定的 $n$ 項，所以可以逐項取極限","color":"violet","on":"冪次"}],"t":[374020,381920]},{"show":["負整數、分數次方：之後用除法法則、隱函數微分補證"],"say":"負數和分數次方，等學了除法法則和隱函數微分再補證。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"負整數、分數次方：之後用除法法則、隱函數微分補證"}],"t":[381920,398070]}]},{"title":"重點整理","beats":[{"show":["• $(c)'=0$，$(x)'=1$","• 冪次法則：$(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$，負數、分數次方都能用"],"say":"整理一下：冪次法則是次方掉下來、次方減 1；常數倍和加減可以逐項微，乘法不行；分式根號先改寫成次方。下一課，學三角函數的導數。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• $(c)'=0$，$(x)'=1$"},{"do":"write","line":"• 冪次法則：$(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$，負數、分數次方都能用","on":"是次"},{"do":"write","line":"• 線性：常數倍提出來，加減逐項微","on":"常數"},{"do":"write","line":"• 乘法不能逐項微：$(fg)'\\ne f'g'$","on":"減可"},{"do":"write","line":"• 分式、根號：先改寫成次方，再微","on":"不行"},{"do":"write","line":"• 證明：二項式展開，帶 $h$ 的項都消失","on":"寫成"},{"do":"write","line":"下一課：三角函數微分","on":"學三"}],"t":[398070,416261]}]}],"checks":[{"ask":"$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\,x^{-3}=$？","options":[{"label":"$-3x^{-4}$","correct":true},{"label":"$-3x^{-2}$","why":"次方減 $1$：$-3-1=-4$，不是 $-2$（往更負的方向走）"},{"label":"$3x^{-4}$","why":"係數是 $n=-3$，負號要帶下來"},{"label":"$-\\dfrac{1}{3}x^{-4}$","why":"次方是乘到前面，不是除"}]},{"ask":"$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\big(4x^3-x+9\\big)=$？","options":[{"label":"$12x^2-1$","correct":true},{"label":"$12x^2-1+9$","why":"常數 $9$ 的導數是 $0$，不會留下來"},{"label":"$12x^2$","why":"$-x$ 的導數是 $-1$，不是 $0$"},{"label":"$4x^2-1$","why":"次方 $3$ 要掉下來乘上係數 $4$"}]},{"ask":"$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\,\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt x}=$？","options":[{"label":"$-\\dfrac12x^{-3/2}$","correct":true},{"label":"$-\\dfrac12x^{-1/2}$","why":"係數對了，但次方忘了減 $1$"},{"label":"$\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt x}$","why":"那是 $\\sqrt x$ 的導數；這裡是 $\\sqrt x$ 分之一"},{"label":"$-\\dfrac12x^{1/2}$","why":"$-\\frac12-1=-\\frac32$，不是 $+\\frac12$"}]}],"practice":[{"id":"tmpl-der-simple-power-001","core":true},{"id":"fd-der-002","core":true},{"id":"der-001","core":true},{"id":"der-004","core":true},{"id":"fd-der-010","core":true},{"id":"cx-der-001","core":true},{"id":"tb-tan-002"},{"id":"rel-basic-010"},{"id":"td-der-002"},{"id":"db-tan-001"},{"id":"cg-2b-001"},{"id":"cg-2b-002"},{"id":"cg-2b-003"}]},"derivative-trig":{"id":"derivative-trig","prerequisites":["derivative-power-rules","limit-trig-standard","trig-identities"],"next":["derivative-exp"],"related":["chain-rule","quotient-rule"],"objectives":["背熟六個三角函數的導數，並用「co 開頭的帶負號」記正負","說出這些公式只在弧度下成立的原因","算三角函數在某一點的切線斜率，以及認出 $\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin(a+h)-\\sin a}{h}$ 是哪個函數在哪一點的導數","用和角公式與標準極限證明 $\\sin$、$\\cos$、$\\tan$、$\\sec$ 的導數"],"concept":[{"heading":"① 從圖看 $(\\sin x)'$","body":["猜：","這只是直覺，不是證明；證明在 ⑤","同樣看 $\\cos x$：在 $0$ 是最高點（斜率 $0$），接著往下（斜率負）"],"tex":["\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin x=\\cos x","\\frac{d}{dx}\\cos x=-\\sin x"]},{"heading":"② 六個公式","body":["記法：co 開頭的（$\\cos,\\cot,\\csc$）帶負號","每一對：把左邊公式的每個函數都換成「co 版」，再加負號","例：$(\\tan)'=\\sec^2$ → $(\\cot)'=-\\csc^2$；$(\\sec)'=\\sec\\tan$ → $(\\csc)'=-\\csc\\cot$","例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}(\\sin x+\\cos x)$","線性：一項一項微","在 $x=\\frac\\pi4$ 是 $0$：$\\sin x+\\cos x$ 在那裡到最高點 $\\sqrt2$"],"tex":["\\def\\arraystretch{1.4}\\begin{array}{ll}(\\sin x)'=\\cos x & (\\cos x)'=-\\sin x\\\\(\\tan x)'=\\sec^2x & (\\cot x)'=-\\csc^2x\\\\(\\sec x)'=\\sec x\\tan x\\; & (\\csc x)'=-\\csc x\\cot x\\end{array}","=\\cos x-\\sin x"]},{"heading":"② 切線斜率與切線","body":["$y=\\tan x$ 在 $x=\\dfrac\\pi4$","斜率：$\\sec^2\\dfrac\\pi4=\\Big(\\dfrac{1}{\\cos\\frac\\pi4}\\Big)^2=(\\sqrt2)^2=2$","切點：$\\tan\\dfrac\\pi4=1$","混在一起：$f(x)=2\\sec x+\\cot x$，求 $f'\\big(\\frac\\pi3\\big)$","$\\sec\\frac\\pi3=2$，$\\tan\\frac\\pi3=\\sqrt3$，$\\csc\\frac\\pi3=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt3}$","$\\csc^2\\frac\\pi3=\\frac43$；數值 $\\approx5.595$"],"tex":["y-1=2\\Big(x-\\frac\\pi4\\Big)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=2x+1-\\frac\\pi2","f'(x)=2\\sec x\\tan x-\\csc^2x","f'\\Big(\\frac\\pi3\\Big)=2\\cdot2\\cdot\\sqrt3-\\frac43=4\\sqrt3-\\frac43"]},{"heading":"③ 只在弧度下成立","body":["公式的證明用到（⑤）：","用度量：$h$ 度 $=\\dfrac{\\pi h}{180}$ 弧度","所以用度的話：","弧度是讓係數剛好是 1 的單位","直覺：弧度下，單位圓上走過的弧長 = 角度數；$\\sin h$（高）和弧長 $h$ 在 $h$ 很小時幾乎一樣"],"tex":["\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin h}{h}=1\\quad(h\\text{ 用弧度})","\\frac{\\sin(h^\\circ)}{h}\\to\\frac{\\pi}{180}\\approx0.01745","\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin(x^\\circ)=\\frac{\\pi}{180}\\cos(x^\\circ)"]},{"heading":"④ 公式本身就是極限","body":["導數的定義：","認法：$\\frac{f(a+h)-f(a)}{h}$，找出 $f$ 和 $a$","例：$\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin\\big(\\frac\\pi6+h\\big)-\\frac12}{h}$","$\\frac12=\\sin\\frac\\pi6$：$f=\\sin$，$a=\\frac\\pi6$"],"tex":["\\begin{aligned}&\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin(a+h)-\\sin a}{h}\\\\&=(\\sin x)'\\Big|_{x=a}=\\cos a\\end{aligned}","=\\cos\\frac\\pi6=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}"]},{"heading":"⑤ 證明：$\\sin$ 與 $\\cos$","body":["需要：$\\dfrac{\\sin h}{h}\\to1$，$\\dfrac{\\cos h-1}{h}\\to0$","第二條：$\\frac{\\cos h-1}{h}=-\\frac{1-\\cos h}{h^2}\\cdot h\\to-\\frac12\\cdot0=0$","和角公式：$\\sin(x+h)=\\sin x\\cos h+\\cos x\\sin h$","$h\\to0$：$\\sin x\\cdot0+\\cos x\\cdot1$","$\\cos(x+h)=\\cos x\\cos h-\\sin x\\sin h$"],"tex":["\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{\\sin(x+h)-\\sin x}{h}\\\\&=\\sin x\\cdot\\frac{\\cos h-1}{h}+\\cos x\\cdot\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\end{aligned}","(\\sin x)'=\\cos x","\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{\\cos(x+h)-\\cos x}{h}\\\\&=\\cos x\\cdot\\frac{\\cos h-1}{h}-\\sin x\\cdot\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\end{aligned}","\\to\\cos x\\cdot0-\\sin x\\cdot1=-\\sin x"]},{"heading":"⑤ 證明：$\\tan$ 與 $\\sec$","body":["在 $\\cos x\\ne0$ 的地方。通分：","分子是差角公式：$\\sin\\big((x+h)-x\\big)=\\sin h$","$h\\to0$：$\\cos(x+h)\\to\\cos x$（$\\cos$ 連續）","前一塊 $=-\\dfrac{\\cos(x+h)-\\cos x}{h}\\to-(-\\sin x)=\\sin x$","$\\cot$、$\\csc$：同樣的方法（在 $\\sin x\\ne0$ 的地方）"],"tex":["\\begin{aligned}&\\tan(x+h)-\\tan x\\\\&=\\frac{\\sin(x+h)\\cos x-\\cos(x+h)\\sin x}{\\cos(x+h)\\cos x}\\end{aligned}","\\frac{\\tan(x+h)-\\tan x}{h}=\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\cos(x+h)\\cos x}","(\\tan x)'=\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}=\\sec^2x","\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{\\sec(x+h)-\\sec x}{h}\\\\&=\\frac{\\cos x-\\cos(x+h)}{h}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\cos(x+h)\\cos x}\\end{aligned}","(\\sec x)'=\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos^2x}=\\sec x\\tan x"]},{"heading":"重點整理","body":["• 圖：$\\sin$ 的斜率描出 $\\cos$","• $(\\sin)'=\\cos$，$(\\tan)'=\\sec^2$，$(\\sec)'=\\sec\\tan$","• co 開頭帶負號：$(\\cos)'=-\\sin$，$(\\cot)'=-\\csc^2$，$(\\csc)'=-\\csc\\cot$","• 只在弧度下成立：因為 $\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\to1$ 要用弧度","• $\\frac{f(a+h)-f(a)}{h}$ 的極限：認出 $f$、$a$，用公式","• 證明：和角公式 ＋ 標準極限","下一課：指數函數微分"]}],"workedExamples":[{"title":"逐項微分","prompt":"$\\frac{d}{dx} (\\sin x + \\cos x)$","problemId":"der-002","steps":["加減可以逐項微分。","$(\\sin x)' = \\cos x$。","$(\\cos x)' = -\\sin x$，負號不能漏。","合起來 $\\cos x - \\sin x$。"],"answer":"$\\cos x - \\sin x$"},{"title":"$\\tan x$ 在 $\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ 的切線","prompt":"求 $y = \\tan x$ 在 $x = \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ 的切線斜率與切線方程式。","problemId":"tb-tan-004","steps":["$(\\tan x)' = \\sec^2 x = \\frac{1}{\\cos^2 x}$。","$\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$，$\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) = \\frac{1}{2}$，所以斜率 $= \\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{2}} = 2$。","切點：$\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) = 1$，切點是 $(\\frac{\\pi}{4}, 1)$。","切線：$y - 1 = 2(x - \\frac{\\pi}{4})$，即 $y = 2x + 1 - \\frac{\\pi}{2}$。"],"answer":"斜率 2；$y = 2x + 1 - \\frac{\\pi}{2}$"},{"title":"$\\sec$ 與 $\\cot$ 混在一起","prompt":"$f(x) = 2 \\sec x + \\cot x$，求 $f'\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$。","steps":["$f'(x) = 2 \\sec x \\tan x - \\csc^2 x$。","$x = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$：$\\cos = \\frac{1}{2}$，所以 $\\sec = 2$；$\\tan = \\sqrt{3}$；$\\sin = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$，所以 $\\csc = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}$，$\\csc^2 = \\frac{4}{3}$。","$f'\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right) = 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot \\sqrt{3} - \\frac{4}{3} = 4\\sqrt{3} - \\frac{4}{3}$。"],"answer":"$4\\sqrt{3} - \\frac{4}{3}$"}],"pitfalls":["$(\\cos x)'$ 寫成 $\\sin x$，漏了負號。","$(\\tan x)'$ 寫成 $\\sec x$，漏了平方。","計算機或心算用度：$x$ 是 30 而不是 $\\frac{\\pi}{6}$。","把 $\\sec x$ 的導數記成 $\\tan x$，或記成 $\\sec^2 x$（那是 $\\tan$ 的）。","$\\sin 2x$ 直接寫成 $\\cos 2x$；裡面不是單純的 $x$ 時要用〈連鎖律 I：兩層〉。"],"voice":"736e4d61","sections":[{"title":"從圖看 $(\\sin x)'$","beats":[{"show":["藍：sin x 和它的切線；綠點：切線斜率"],"say":"先用圖猜。藍色是正弦，紅色虛線是它在 a 的切線。在 0 的地方，切線很陡，斜率是 1。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"sn","window":[-0.3,6.6,-1.7,1.7],"fn":[{"expr":"sin(x)","color":"blue","label":"y = sin x"},{"expr":"cos(a)*(x-a)+sin(a)","color":"red","dash":true},{"expr":"cos(x)","color":"green","dash":true,"label":"y = cos x"}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"sin(a)","color":"blue"},{"x":"a","y":"cos(a)","color":"green"}],"params":{"a":{"min":0,"max":6.28,"value":0,"label":"切點 a"}},"readout":"切線斜率 = {cos(a)}","height":280}}},{"do":"write","line":"切線斜率 = 1","on":"線是"},{"do":"write","line":"藍：sin x 和它的切線；綠點：切線斜率","color":"violet","on":"的地"}],"t":[2280,13240]},{"show":["從圖看 $(\\sin x)'$"],"say":"往右走到 2 分之派，正弦到最高點，切線變水平，斜率是 0。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"sn","window":[-0.3,6.6,-1.7,1.7],"fn":[{"expr":"sin(x)","color":"blue","label":"y = sin x"},{"expr":"cos(a)*(x-a)+sin(a)","color":"red","dash":true},{"expr":"cos(x)","color":"green","dash":true,"label":"y = cos x"}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"sin(a)","color":"blue"},{"x":"a","y":"cos(a)","color":"green"}],"params":{"a":{"min":0,"max":6.28,"value":0,"label":"切點 a"}},"readout":"切線斜率 = {cos(a)}","height":280},"vals":{"a":1.5708}}},{"do":"write","line":"切線斜率 = −0.000003673","on":"高點"}],"t":[13240,20160]},{"show":["從圖看 $(\\sin x)'$"],"say":"走到派，正弦往下穿過 0，斜率是負 1。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"sn","window":[-0.3,6.6,-1.7,1.7],"fn":[{"expr":"sin(x)","color":"blue","label":"y = sin x"},{"expr":"cos(a)*(x-a)+sin(a)","color":"red","dash":true},{"expr":"cos(x)","color":"green","dash":true,"label":"y = cos x"}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"sin(a)","color":"blue"},{"x":"a","y":"cos(a)","color":"green"}],"params":{"a":{"min":0,"max":6.28,"value":0,"label":"切點 a"}},"readout":"切線斜率 = {cos(a)}","height":280},"vals":{"a":3.1416}}},{"do":"write","line":"切線斜率 = −1","on":"斜率"}],"t":[20160,25350]},{"show":["從圖看 $(\\sin x)'$"],"say":"把每一點的斜率畫成綠點，綠點描出來的，剛好是餘弦的圖形。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"sn","window":[-0.3,6.6,-1.7,1.7],"fn":[{"expr":"sin(x)","color":"blue","label":"y = sin x"},{"expr":"cos(a)*(x-a)+sin(a)","color":"red","dash":true},{"expr":"cos(x)","color":"green","dash":true,"label":"y = cos x"}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"sin(a)","color":"blue"},{"x":"a","y":"cos(a)","color":"green"}],"params":{"a":{"min":0,"max":6.28,"value":0,"label":"切點 a"}},"readout":"切線斜率 = {cos(a)}","height":280},"vals":{"a":6}}},{"do":"write","line":"切線斜率 = 0.9602","on":"描出"}],"t":[25350,33900]},{"show":["猜：","$\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin x=\\cos x$"],"say":"所以我們猜：正弦的導數，就是餘弦。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"猜："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx1:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}\\sin x=\\cos x}}$","color":"red","on":"正弦"},{"do":"box","term":"bx1","color":"red","on":"的導"},{"do":"write","line":"　這只是直覺，不是證明；證明在 ⑤","color":"violet","on":"就是"}],"t":[33900,38860]},{"show":["同樣看 $\\cos x$：在 $0$ 是最高點（斜率 $0$），接著往下（斜率負）"],"say":"同樣看餘弦：在 0 是最高點，斜率 0；接著往下走，斜率是負的，形狀像負的正弦。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"同樣看 $\\cos x$：在 $0$ 是最高點（斜率 $0$），接著往下（斜率負）"}],"t":[38860,48310]},{"show":["$\\frac{d}{dx}\\cos x=-\\sin x$"],"say":"所以餘弦的導數是負的正弦。這個負號很重要。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx2:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}\\cos x=-\\sin x}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx2","color":"red","on":"正弦"}],"t":[48310,55110]}]},{"title":"六個公式","beats":[{"show":["$\\def\\arraystretch{1.4}\\begin{array}{ll}(\\sin x)'=\\cos x & (\\cos x)'=-\\sin x\\\\(\\tan x)'=\\sec^2x & (\\cot x)'=-\\csc^2x\\\\(\\sec x)'=\\sec x\\tan x\\; & (\\csc x)'=-\\csc x\\cot x\\end{array}$"],"say":"六個公式排成三對：正弦和餘弦、正切和餘切、正割和餘割。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx3:\\displaystyle \\def\\arraystretch{1.4}{\\begin{array}{ll}(\\sin x)'=\\cos x & (\\cos x)'=-\\sin x\\\\(\\tan x)'=\\sec^2x & (\\cot x)'=-\\csc^2x\\\\(\\sec x)'=\\sec x\\tan x\\; & (\\csc x)'=-\\csc x\\cot x\\end{array}}}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx3","color":"red","on":"正切"}],"t":[55110,62340]},{"show":["記法：co 開頭的（$\\cos,\\cot,\\csc$）帶負號"],"say":"記法：co 開頭的三個，也就是餘弦、餘切、餘割，導數都帶負號。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"記法：co 開頭的（$\\cos,\\cot,\\csc$）帶負號"}],"t":[62340,70050]},{"show":["每一對：把左邊公式的每個函數都換成「co 版」，再加負號"],"say":"而且每一對是對稱的：左邊的公式，把每個函數換成 co 開頭的版本，再加一個負號，就是右邊。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"每一對：把左邊公式的每個函數都換成「co 版」，再加負號"},{"do":"write","line":"　例：$(\\tan)'=\\sec^2$ → $(\\cot)'=-\\csc^2$；$(\\sec)'=\\sec\\tan$ → $(\\csc)'=-\\csc\\cot$","color":"violet","on":"co"}],"t":[70050,80250]},{"show":["例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}(\\sin x+\\cos x)$"],"say":"例子：正弦加餘弦。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}(\\sin x+\\cos x)$"}],"t":[80250,84780]},{"show":["線性：一項一項微","$=\\cos x-\\sin x$"],"say":"上一課的線性還是能用：一項一項微。正弦變餘弦，餘弦變負正弦，答案是餘弦減正弦。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"線性：一項一項微"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx4:\\displaystyle =\\cos x-\\sin x}}$","on":"一項#1"},{"do":"box","term":"bx4","on":"變餘"},{"do":"write","line":"　在 $x=\\frac\\pi4$ 是 $0$：$\\sin x+\\cos x$ 在那裡到最高點 $\\sqrt2$","color":"violet","on":"答案"}],"t":[84780,95070]}],"check":0},{"title":"切線斜率與切線","beats":[{"show":["$y=\\tan x$ 在 $x=\\dfrac\\pi4$"],"say":"例子：正切 x 在 4 分之派的切線。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$y=\\tan x$ 在 $x=\\dfrac\\pi4$"}],"t":[105450,109940]},{"show":["斜率：$\\sec^2\\dfrac\\pi4=\\Big(\\dfrac{1}{\\cos\\frac\\pi4}\\Big)^2=(\\sqrt2)^2=2$"],"say":"斜率是正割平方。餘弦 4 分之派是根號 2 分之 1，正割是根號 2，平方是 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"斜率：$\\sec^2\\dfrac\\pi4=\\Big(\\dfrac{1}{\\cos\\frac\\pi4}\\Big)^2=(\\sqrt2)^2=2$"}],"t":[109940,120230]},{"show":["切點：$\\tan\\dfrac\\pi4=1$","$y-1=2\\Big(x-\\frac\\pi4\\Big)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=2x+1-\\frac\\pi2$"],"say":"切點的 y 是正切 4 分之派，等於 1。點斜式寫出來，整理得 y 等於 2x 加 1 減 2 分之派。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"切點：$\\tan\\dfrac\\pi4=1$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx5:\\displaystyle y-1=2\\Big(x-\\frac\\pi4\\Big)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=2x+1-\\frac\\pi2}}$","color":"red","on":"點斜"},{"do":"box","term":"bx5","color":"red","on":"等於#2"}],"t":[120230,131730]},{"show":["混在一起：$f(x)=2\\sec x+\\cot x$，求 $f'\\big(\\frac\\pi3\\big)$"],"say":"再一個：f 等於 2 倍正割加餘切，求在 3 分之派的導數。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"混在一起：$f(x)=2\\sec x+\\cot x$，求 $f'\\big(\\frac\\pi3\\big)$"}],"t":[131730,138130]},{"show":["$f'(x)=2\\sec x\\tan x-\\csc^2x$"],"say":"一項一項微：2 倍正割微成 2 倍正割乘正切；餘切是 co 開頭，微成負的餘割平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle f'(x)=2\\sec x\\tan x-\\csc^2x$"}],"t":[138130,146930]},{"show":["$\\sec\\frac\\pi3=2$，$\\tan\\frac\\pi3=\\sqrt3$，$\\csc\\frac\\pi3=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt3}$"],"say":"代值：正割 3 分之派是 2，正切是根號 3，餘割是根號 3 分之 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\sec\\frac\\pi3=2$，$\\tan\\frac\\pi3=\\sqrt3$，$\\csc\\frac\\pi3=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt3}$"}],"t":[146930,154530]},{"show":["$f'\\Big(\\frac\\pi3\\Big)=2\\cdot2\\cdot\\sqrt3-\\frac43=4\\sqrt3-\\frac43$"],"say":"所以是 4 根號 3，減 3 分之 4，大約 5.59。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx6:\\displaystyle f'\\Big(\\frac\\pi3\\Big)=2\\cdot2\\cdot\\sqrt3-\\frac43=4\\sqrt3-\\frac43}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx6","color":"red","on":"分之"},{"do":"write","line":"　$\\csc^2\\frac\\pi3=\\frac43$；數值 $\\approx5.595$","color":"violet","on":"大約"}],"t":[154530,163160]}]},{"title":"只在弧度下成立","beats":[{"show":["公式的證明用到（⑤）：","$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin h}{h}=1\\quad(h\\text{ 用弧度})$"],"say":"這些公式有一個前提：x 要用弧度。因為證明裡用到正弦 h 除以 h 趨近 1，而這個極限只有在弧度下才是 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"公式的證明用到（⑤）："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx7:\\displaystyle \\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin h}{h}=1\\quad(h\\text{ 用弧度})}}$","on":"為證"},{"do":"box","term":"bx7","on":"而這"}],"t":[163160,176130]},{"show":["用度量：$h$ 度 $=\\dfrac{\\pi h}{180}$ 弧度","$\\frac{\\sin(h^\\circ)}{h}\\to\\frac{\\pi}{180}\\approx0.01745$"],"say":"如果用度來量，h 度等於 180 分之派 h 弧度，這個極限就變成 180 分之派，大約 0.01745，不是 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"用度量：$h$ 度 $=\\dfrac{\\pi h}{180}$ 弧度"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{\\sin(h^\\circ)}{h}\\to\\frac{\\pi}{180}\\approx0.01745$","on":"限就"}],"t":[176130,189980]},{"show":["所以用度的話：","$\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin(x^\\circ)=\\frac{\\pi}{180}\\cos(x^\\circ)$"],"say":"結果用度的話，正弦的導數會多一個討厭的 180 分之派。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"所以用度的話："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx8:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}\\sin(x^\\circ)=\\frac{\\pi}{180}\\cos(x^\\circ)}}$","on":"的導"},{"do":"box","term":"bx8","on":"18"}],"t":[189980,196110]},{"show":["弧度是讓係數剛好是 1 的單位"],"say":"換句話說，弧度就是讓這個係數剛好等於 1 的那個單位。這也是微積分裡一律用弧度的原因。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"弧度是讓係數剛好是 1 的單位","color":"red"},{"do":"write","line":"　直覺：弧度下，單位圓上走過的弧長 = 角度數；$\\sin h$（高）和弧長 $h$ 在 $h$ 很小時幾乎一樣","color":"violet","on":"的那"}],"t":[196110,205930]}],"predict":{"ask":"$x$ 用度量時，$\\sin(x^\\circ)$ 在 $x=0$ 的斜率最接近？","options":[{"label":"$0.017$","correct":true},{"label":"$1$","why":"那是弧度的結果"},{"label":"$57.3$","why":"把 $\\frac{180}{\\pi}$ 顛倒了：$x$ 每增加 $1$ 度，角度只多 $\\frac\\pi{180}$ 弧度"}]}},{"title":"公式本身就是極限","beats":[{"show":["導數的定義：","$\\begin{aligned}&\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin(a+h)-\\sin a}{h}\\\\&=(\\sin x)'\\Big|_{x=a}=\\cos a\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"反過來看：導數的定義就是一個極限。所以看到這種長相的極限，可以直接用公式算。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"導數的定義："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx9:\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}&\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin(a+h)-\\sin a}{h}\\\\&=(\\sin x)'\\Big|_{x=a}=\\cos a\\end{aligned}}}}$","on":"義就"},{"do":"box","term":"bx9","on":"看到"},{"do":"write","line":"　認法：$\\frac{f(a+h)-f(a)}{h}$，找出 $f$ 和 $a$","color":"violet","on":"可以"}],"t":[217050,226350]},{"show":["例：$\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin\\big(\\frac\\pi6+h\\big)-\\frac12}{h}$"],"say":"例子：正弦 6 分之派加 h，減 2 分之 1，除以 h。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\sin\\big(\\frac\\pi6+h\\big)-\\frac12}{h}$"}],"t":[226350,234020]},{"show":["$\\frac12=\\sin\\frac\\pi6$：$f=\\sin$，$a=\\frac\\pi6$","$=\\cos\\frac\\pi6=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$"],"say":"2 分之 1 正好是正弦 6 分之派。所以這是正弦在 6 分之派的導數，等於餘弦 6 分之派，根號 3 除以 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\frac12=\\sin\\frac\\pi6$：$f=\\sin$，$a=\\frac\\pi6$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx10:\\displaystyle =\\cos\\frac\\pi6=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}}}$","color":"red","on":"所以"},{"do":"box","term":"bx10","color":"red","on":"餘弦"}],"t":[234020,246520]}],"check":1},{"title":"證明：$\\sin$ 與 $\\cos$","beats":[{"show":["需要：$\\dfrac{\\sin h}{h}\\to1$，$\\dfrac{\\cos h-1}{h}\\to0$"],"say":"現在證明。需要兩個標準極限：正弦 h 除以 h 趨近 1，還有餘弦 h 減 1 除以 h 趨近 0。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"需要：$\\dfrac{\\sin h}{h}\\to1$，$\\dfrac{\\cos h-1}{h}\\to0$"},{"do":"write","line":"　第二條：$\\frac{\\cos h-1}{h}=-\\frac{1-\\cos h}{h^2}\\cdot h\\to-\\frac12\\cdot0=0$","color":"violet","on":"還有"}],"t":[255370,265770]},{"show":["和角公式：$\\sin(x+h)=\\sin x\\cos h+\\cos x\\sin h$"],"say":"用和角公式，把正弦 x 加 h 展開。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"和角公式：$\\sin(x+h)=\\sin x\\cos h+\\cos x\\sin h$"}],"t":[265770,270320]},{"show":["$\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{\\sin(x+h)-\\sin x}{h}\\\\&=\\sin x\\cdot\\frac{\\cos h-1}{h}+\\cos x\\cdot\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"減掉正弦 x，重新分組：正弦 x 乘餘弦 h 減 1 除以 h，加上餘弦 x 乘正弦 h 除以 h。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{\\sin(x+h)-\\sin x}{h}\\\\&=\\sin x\\cdot\\frac{\\cos h-1}{h}+\\cos x\\cdot\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\end{aligned}}$"}],"t":[270320,282860]},{"show":["$h\\to0$：$\\sin x\\cdot0+\\cos x\\cdot1$","$(\\sin x)'=\\cos x$"],"say":"h 趨近 0，第一塊趨近 0，第二塊趨近 1，得到餘弦 x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$h\\to0$：$\\sin x\\cdot0+\\cos x\\cdot1$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx11:\\displaystyle (\\sin x)'=\\cos x}}$","color":"red","on":"趨近#2"},{"do":"box","term":"bx11","color":"red","on":"得到"}],"t":[282860,290980]},{"show":["$\\cos(x+h)=\\cos x\\cos h-\\sin x\\sin h$","$\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{\\cos(x+h)-\\cos x}{h}\\\\&=\\cos x\\cdot\\frac{\\cos h-1}{h}-\\sin x\\cdot\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"餘弦一樣：和角公式中間是減號，所以分組之後，第二塊前面是負的正弦 x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\cos(x+h)=\\cos x\\cos h-\\sin x\\sin h$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{\\cos(x+h)-\\cos x}{h}\\\\&=\\cos x\\cdot\\frac{\\cos h-1}{h}-\\sin x\\cdot\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\end{aligned}}$","on":"分組"}],"t":[290980,299310]},{"show":["$\\to\\cos x\\cdot0-\\sin x\\cdot1=-\\sin x$"],"say":"取極限，得到負正弦 x。負號就是從和角公式的減號來的。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx12:\\displaystyle \\to\\cos x\\cdot0-\\sin x\\cdot1=-\\sin x}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx12","color":"red","on":"號就"}],"t":[299310,309540]}]},{"title":"證明：$\\tan$ 與 $\\sec$","beats":[{"show":["在 $\\cos x\\ne0$ 的地方。通分：","$\\begin{aligned}&\\tan(x+h)-\\tan x\\\\&=\\frac{\\sin(x+h)\\cos x-\\cos(x+h)\\sin x}{\\cos(x+h)\\cos x}\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"正切和正割，在餘弦不等於 0 的地方證。先把正切 x 加 h 減正切 x 通分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"在 $\\cos x\\ne0$ 的地方。通分："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}&\\tan(x+h)-\\tan x\\\\&=\\frac{\\sin(x+h)\\cos x-\\cos(x+h)\\sin x}{\\cos(x+h)\\cos x}\\end{aligned}}$","on":"先把"}],"t":[309540,320000]},{"show":["分子是差角公式：$\\sin\\big((x+h)-x\\big)=\\sin h$","$\\frac{\\tan(x+h)-\\tan x}{h}=\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\cos(x+h)\\cos x}$"],"say":"分子剛好是差角公式，等於正弦 h。除以 h，拆成正弦 h 除以 h，乘上一個分式。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"分子是差角公式：$\\sin\\big((x+h)-x\\big)=\\sin h$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{\\tan(x+h)-\\tan x}{h}=\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\cos(x+h)\\cos x}$","on":"拆成"}],"t":[320000,331610]},{"show":["$h\\to0$：$\\cos(x+h)\\to\\cos x$（$\\cos$ 連續）","$(\\tan x)'=\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}=\\sec^2x$"],"say":"h 趨近 0，正弦 h 除以 h 趨近 1；餘弦連續，餘弦 x 加 h 趨近餘弦 x。所以得到餘弦平方分之一，就是正割平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$h\\to0$：$\\cos(x+h)\\to\\cos x$（$\\cos$ 連續）"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx13:\\displaystyle (\\tan x)'=\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}=\\sec^2x}}$","color":"red","on":"餘弦#1"},{"do":"box","term":"bx13","color":"red","on":"所以"}],"t":[331610,345110]},{"show":["$\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{\\sec(x+h)-\\sec x}{h}\\\\&=\\frac{\\cos x-\\cos(x+h)}{h}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\cos(x+h)\\cos x}\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"正割也一樣通分。分子變成餘弦 x 減餘弦 x 加 h，除以 h。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{\\sec(x+h)-\\sec x}{h}\\\\&=\\frac{\\cos x-\\cos(x+h)}{h}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\cos(x+h)\\cos x}\\end{aligned}}$"}],"t":[345110,352530]},{"show":["前一塊 $=-\\dfrac{\\cos(x+h)-\\cos x}{h}\\to-(-\\sin x)=\\sin x$"],"say":"前一塊是餘弦差商的相反數，趨近負的負正弦，也就是正弦 x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"前一塊 $=-\\dfrac{\\cos(x+h)-\\cos x}{h}\\to-(-\\sin x)=\\sin x$"}],"t":[352530,359470]},{"show":["$(\\sec x)'=\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos^2x}=\\sec x\\tan x$"],"say":"後一塊趨近餘弦平方分之一。合起來，餘弦平方分之正弦 x，拆成正割乘正切。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx14:\\displaystyle (\\sec x)'=\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos^2x}=\\sec x\\tan x}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx14","color":"red","on":"弦平#2"}],"t":[359470,368820]},{"show":["$\\cot$、$\\csc$：同樣的方法（在 $\\sin x\\ne0$ 的地方）"],"say":"餘切和餘割，在正弦不等於 0 的地方，用完全一樣的方法，會多出負號。學了除法法則後還有更快的證法。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\cot$、$\\csc$：同樣的方法（在 $\\sin x\\ne0$ 的地方）"}],"t":[368820,391350]}]},{"title":"重點整理","beats":[{"show":["• 圖：$\\sin$ 的斜率描出 $\\cos$","• $(\\sin)'=\\cos$，$(\\tan)'=\\sec^2$，$(\\sec)'=\\sec\\tan$"],"say":"整理一下：正弦的導數是餘弦；co 開頭的三個帶負號；這些公式只在弧度下成立；看到差商的極限，認出是哪個函數在哪一點的導數；證明靠和角公式和標準極限。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• 圖：$\\sin$ 的斜率描出 $\\cos$"},{"do":"write","line":"• $(\\sin)'=\\cos$，$(\\tan)'=\\sec^2$，$(\\sec)'=\\sec\\tan$","on":"co"},{"do":"write","line":"• co 開頭帶負號：$(\\cos)'=-\\sin$，$(\\cot)'=-\\csc^2$，$(\\csc)'=-\\csc\\cot$","on":"這些"},{"do":"write","line":"• 只在弧度下成立：因為 $\\frac{\\sin h}{h}\\to1$ 要用弧度","on":"看到"},{"do":"write","line":"• $\\frac{f(a+h)-f(a)}{h}$ 的極限：認出 $f$、$a$，用公式","on":"哪個"},{"do":"write","line":"• 證明：和角公式 ＋ 標準極限","on":"證明"}],"t":[391350,407260]},{"show":["下一課：指數函數微分"],"say":"下一課，學指數函數的導數。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"下一課：指數函數微分"}],"t":[407260,412891]}]}],"checks":[{"ask":"$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\big(3\\cos x-\\tan x\\big)=$？","options":[{"label":"$-3\\sin x-\\sec^2x$","correct":true},{"label":"$3\\sin x-\\sec^2x$","why":"$\\cos$ 的導數帶負號"},{"label":"$-3\\sin x+\\sec^2x$","why":"$\\tan$ 前面本來就是減號，導數 $\\sec^2x$ 照減"},{"label":"$-3\\sin x-\\sec x\\tan x$","why":"$\\sec x\\tan x$ 是 $\\sec x$ 的導數，$\\tan x$ 的是 $\\sec^2x$"}]},{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{\\cos\\big(\\frac\\pi3+h\\big)-\\cos\\frac\\pi3}{h}=$？","options":[{"label":"$-\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$","why":"漏了負號：$\\cos$ 是 co 開頭"},{"label":"$-\\dfrac12$","why":"那是 $-\\cos\\frac\\pi3$；導數是 $-\\sin$，不是 $-\\cos$"},{"label":"$0$","why":"分子分母都 $\\to0$，是 $\\frac00$ 型，不是 $0$"}]}],"practice":[{"id":"rel-basic-008","core":true},{"id":"fd-der-008","core":true},{"id":"der-002","core":true},{"id":"cx-der-006","core":true},{"id":"tb-tan-004","core":true},{"id":"dd-def-003","core":true},{"id":"cg-2b-004","core":true},{"id":"db-def-002"},{"id":"dd-def-004"},{"id":"gi-102"},{"id":"cg-2b-005"},{"id":"cg-2b-006"},{"id":"db-def-008","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：$x \\to a$ 的寫法，先認出 $1 = \\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$。"}]},"derivative-exp":{"id":"derivative-exp","prerequisites":["derivative-power-rules","exp-log","limit-exp-log-standard"],"next":["derivative-log"],"related":["chain-rule","logarithmic-differentiation"],"objectives":["說出為什麼指數函數的斜率跟自己的高度成正比","用 $(e^x)'=e^x$ 與 $(a^x)'=a^x\\ln a$ 微分並求切線","分清楚 $a^x$（指數）和 $x^a$（冪次）用的是不同公式","證明 $\\frac{a^h-1}{h}\\to\\ln a$"],"concept":[{"heading":"① 斜率跟高度成正比","body":["用定義算 $f(x)=a^x$（$a>0$）：","提出 $a^x$：","$h\\to0$：後面那塊趨近一個只跟 $a$ 有關的常數 $k_a$","意思：斜率 = 常數 × 高度","$k_a=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$ 其實就是 $a^x$ 在 $x=0$ 的斜率（因為 $a^0=1$）"],"tex":["\\frac{a^{x+h}-a^x}{h}=\\frac{a^x\\cdot a^h-a^x}{h}","=a^x\\cdot\\frac{a^h-1}{h}","\\frac{d}{dx}a^x=k_a\\cdot a^x"]},{"heading":"② $e$：讓 $k$ 剛好是 1","body":["$k_a=\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$ 的數值：","$k_2<1<k_3$：中間某個底數讓 $k$ 剛好是 1","底數越大，在 $x=0$ 的切線越陡，$k_a$ 跟著變大","這個底數就是 $e\\approx2.71828$","1.10 的 $\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{e^h-1}{h}=1$ 說的正是 $k_e=1$"],"tex":["\\def\\arraystretch{1.3}\\begin{array}{c|ccc}h & 0.1 & 0.01 & 0.001\\\\\\hline a=2 & 0.7177 & 0.6956 & 0.6934\\\\ a=3 & 1.1612 & 1.1047 & 1.0992\\end{array}","\\frac{d}{dx}e^x=e^x"]},{"heading":"② 例題","body":["$f(x)=3e^x-x^2$，求 $f'(x)$ 與 $f'(0)$","線性，一項一項微：","切線過原點：$y=e^x$ 在 $x=1$","切點 $(1,e)$，斜率 $e^1=e$"],"tex":["f'(x)=3e^x-2x","f'(0)=3e^0-0=3","y-e=e(x-1)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=ex"]},{"heading":"② 試一題","body":["斜率 = 高度：往左走 1 單位，高度剛好降到 $0$"]},{"heading":"③ 一般底數","body":["要算 $k_a=\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$","1.10 的標準極限：","$a=e$：$\\ln e=1$，回到 $(e^x)'=e^x$","例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}2^x=2^x\\ln2$","在 $x=3$：","$0<a<1$：$\\ln a<0$，斜率是負的","例：$\\big((\\frac12)^x\\big)'=(\\frac12)^x\\ln\\frac12=-(\\frac12)^x\\ln2$"],"tex":["\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}=\\ln a","\\frac{d}{dx}a^x=a^x\\ln a","2^3\\ln2=8\\ln2\\approx5.545"]},{"heading":"④ $a^x$ 不是 $x^a$","body":["例：$x^2$ vs $2^x$","常見錯誤：$(2^x)'\\ne x\\cdot2^{x-1}$"],"tex":["\\def\\arraystretch{1.4}\\begin{array}{l|l|l}&\\text{變數在}&\\text{導數}\\\\\\hline x^a\\ \\text{冪次}&\\text{底數}&ax^{a-1}\\\\ a^x\\ \\text{指數}&\\text{指數}&a^x\\ln a\\end{array}","(x^2)'=2x,\\qquad(2^x)'=2^x\\ln2"]},{"heading":"⑤ 證明 $\\frac{a^h-1}{h}\\to\\ln a$","body":["$a=1$：$\\frac{1-1}{h}=0=\\ln1$，成立。設 $a\\ne1$","換成 $e$：$a^h=e^{h\\ln a}$","令 $t=h\\ln a$：","$\\ln a\\ne0$，所以可以除；$h\\ne0$ 時 $t\\ne0$","$h\\to0$ 時 $t\\to0$，用 1.10：$\\dfrac{e^t-1}{t}\\to1$","合起來：$(a^x)'=a^x\\cdot k_a=a^x\\ln a$","再往回追：$\\frac{e^t-1}{t}\\to1$ 是從 $\\frac{\\ln(1+x)}{x}\\to1$ 推出來的（1.10）"],"tex":["\\frac{a^h-1}{h}=\\frac{e^{t}-1}{t}\\cdot\\ln a","\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}=1\\cdot\\ln a=\\ln a\\qquad\\blacksquare"]},{"heading":"重點整理","body":["• $(a^x)'=a^x\\cdot k_a$：斜率 跟高度成正比","• $e$：讓 $k=1$ 的底數，$(e^x)'=e^x$","• 一般底數：$(a^x)'=a^x\\ln a$","• 變數在指數 → 指數公式；變數在底數 → 冪次法則","• 證明：$a^h=e^{h\\ln a}$，用 $\\frac{e^t-1}{t}\\to1$","下一課：對數函數微分"]}],"workedExamples":[{"title":"$e^x$ 與多項式混在一起","prompt":"$f(x) = 3e^x - x^2$，求 $f'(x)$ 與 $f'(0)$。","steps":["逐項：$(3e^x)' = 3e^x$（常數倍留著），$(x^2)' = 2x$。","$f'(x) = 3e^x - 2x$。","$f'(0) = 3 \\cdot 1 - 0 = 3$。"],"answer":"$f'(x) = 3e^x - 2x$；$f'(0) = 3$"},{"title":"底數 2","prompt":"$\\frac{d}{dx} 2^x$，以及它在 $x = 3$ 的值。","problemId":"lec-03-m5","steps":["次方在變，是指數函數：$(2^x)' = 2^x \\ln 2$。","$x = 3$：$2^3 \\ln 2 = 8 \\ln 2 \\approx 5.545$。"],"answer":"$2^x \\ln 2$；$8 \\ln 2$"},{"title":"$e^x$ 在 $x = 1$ 的切線過原點","prompt":"求 $y = e^x$ 在 $x = 1$ 的切線方程式。","steps":["斜率：$(e^x)'$ 在 $x = 1$ 是 $e$。","切點：$(1, e)$。","$y - e = e(x - 1)$，整理得 $y = ex$。","常數項剛好消掉，這條切線通過原點。"],"answer":"$y = ex$"}],"pitfalls":["用冪次法則微分 $e^x$，寫成 $x e^{x-1}$。","$(2^x)'$ 寫成 $2^x$，漏了 $\\ln 2$；或寫成 $x \\cdot 2^{x-1}$。","$(e^2)'$ 寫成 $e^2$。$e^2$ 是常數，導數是 0。","$(e^x)' = e^x$ 是對的，但 $e^{3x}$ 直接寫成 $e^{3x}$；裡面不是單純的 $x$ 要用〈連鎖律 I：兩層〉。"],"voice":"62cd2da7","sections":[{"title":"斜率跟高度成正比","beats":[{"show":["用定義算 $f(x)=a^x$（$a>0$）：","$\\frac{a^{x+h}-a^x}{h}=\\frac{a^x\\cdot a^h-a^x}{h}$"],"say":"用定義算 a 的 x 次方的導數。a 的 x 加 h 次方，拆成 a 的 x 次方乘 a 的 h 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"用定義算 $f(x)=a^x$（$a>0$）："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{a^{x+h}-a^x}{h}=\\frac{a^x\\cdot a^h-a^x}{h}$","on":"次方#2"}],"t":[4490,16440]},{"show":["提出 $a^x$：","$=a^x\\cdot\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$"],"say":"把 a 的 x 次方提出來。剩下的那一塊，a 的 h 次方減 1 除以 h，裡面完全沒有 x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"提出 $a^x$："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle =a^x\\cdot\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$","on":"次方#2"}],"t":[16440,28300]},{"show":["$h\\to0$：後面那塊趨近一個只跟 $a$ 有關的常數 $k_a$","$\\frac{d}{dx}a^x=k_a\\cdot a^x$"],"say":"h 趨近 0 時，後面那塊趨近一個常數，叫它 k a，只跟底數有關。所以導數等於 k a 乘 a 的 x 次方，也就是乘上自己的高度。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$h\\to0$：後面那塊趨近一個只跟 $a$ 有關的常數 $k_a$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx1:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}a^x=k_a\\cdot a^x}}$","color":"red","on":"只跟"},{"do":"box","term":"bx1","color":"red","on":"次方"}],"t":[28300,42800]},{"show":["意思：斜率 = 常數 × 高度"],"say":"意思是：指數函數每一點的斜率，都是那一點高度的固定倍數。長得越高，爬得越快。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"意思：斜率 = 常數 × 高度"},{"do":"write","line":"　$k_a=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$ 其實就是 $a^x$ 在 $x=0$ 的斜率（因為 $a^0=1$）","color":"violet","on":"點高"}],"t":[42800,52290]},{"show":["底數 2：斜率永遠是高度的 0.693 倍"],"say":"看底數 2：在 0 的地方，高度 1，斜率大約 0.693。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"two","window":[-2,3.2,-1,9],"fn":[{"expr":"2^x","color":"blue","label":"y = 2ˣ"},{"expr":"2^a*ln(2)*(x-a)+2^a","color":"red","dash":true}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"2^a","color":"blue"}],"params":{"a":{"min":-1.5,"max":3,"value":0,"label":"切點 a"}},"readout":"高度 = {2^a}，斜率 = {2^a*ln(2)}","height":240}}},{"do":"write","line":"高度 = 1，斜率 = 0.6931","on":"的地"},{"do":"write","line":"底數 2：斜率永遠是高度的 0.693 倍","color":"violet","on":"率大"}],"t":[52290,58840]},{"show":["斜率跟高度成正比"],"say":"往右走，高度變成 8，斜率也跟著變成大約 5.5，還是高度的 0.693 倍。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"two","window":[-2,3.2,-1,9],"fn":[{"expr":"2^x","color":"blue","label":"y = 2ˣ"},{"expr":"2^a*ln(2)*(x-a)+2^a","color":"red","dash":true}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"2^a","color":"blue"}],"params":{"a":{"min":-1.5,"max":3,"value":0,"label":"切點 a"}},"readout":"高度 = {2^a}，斜率 = {2^a*ln(2)}","height":240},"vals":{"a":3}}},{"do":"write","line":"高度 = 8，斜率 = 5.545","on":"還是"}],"t":[58840,69800]}]},{"title":"$e$：讓 $k$ 剛好是 1","beats":[{"show":["$k_a=\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$ 的數值：","$\\def\\arraystretch{1.3}\\begin{array}{c|ccc}h & 0.1 & 0.01 & 0.001\\\\\\hline a=2 & 0.7177 & 0.6956 & 0.6934\\\\ a=3 & 1.1612 & 1.1047 & 1.0992\\end{array}$"],"say":"算算看這個常數。底數 2，k 大約 0.693；底數 3，k 大約 1.099。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$k_a=\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$ 的數值："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\def\\arraystretch{1.3}{\\begin{array}{c|ccc}h & 0.1 & 0.01 & 0.001\\\\\\hline a=2 & 0.7177 & 0.6956 & 0.6934\\\\ a=3 & 1.1612 & 1.1047 & 1.0992\\end{array}}$","on":"69"}],"t":[69800,78950]},{"show":["$k_2<1<k_3$：中間某個底數讓 $k$ 剛好是 1"],"say":"底數 2 的 k 比 1 小，底數 3 的比 1 大。所以 2 和 3 中間，有一個底數讓 k 剛好等於 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$k_2<1<k_3$：中間某個底數讓 $k$ 剛好是 1"},{"do":"write","line":"　底數越大，在 $x=0$ 的切線越陡，$k_a$ 跟著變大","color":"violet","on":"所以"}],"t":[78950,90350]},{"show":["這個底數就是 $e\\approx2.71828$"],"say":"這個底數，就是 e，大約 2.71828。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"這個底數就是 $e\\approx2.71828$","color":"gold"}],"t":[90350,95990]},{"show":["紅：在 0 的切線；綠：斜率 1 的直線"],"say":"圖上，紅色虛線是在 0 的切線，綠色是斜率 1 的直線。把底數從 2 往上調，","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"base","window":[-2,2,-0.5,4],"fn":[{"expr":"b^x","color":"blue","label":"y = bˣ"},{"expr":"x+1","color":"green","dash":true},{"expr":"ln(b)*x+1","color":"red","dash":true}],"points":[{"x":0,"y":1,"color":"red"}],"params":{"b":{"min":2,"max":3,"value":2,"label":"底數 b"}},"readout":"在 0 的斜率 = {ln(b)}","height":240}}},{"do":"write","line":"在 0 的斜率 = 0.6931","on":"切線"},{"do":"write","line":"紅：在 0 的切線；綠：斜率 1 的直線","color":"violet","on":"把底"}],"t":[95990,104940]},{"show":["$e$：讓 $k$ 剛好是 1"],"say":"調到 2.718 左右，紅線剛好疊上綠線：在 0 的斜率剛好是 1。這個底數就是 e。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"base","window":[-2,2,-0.5,4],"fn":[{"expr":"b^x","color":"blue","label":"y = bˣ"},{"expr":"x+1","color":"green","dash":true},{"expr":"ln(b)*x+1","color":"red","dash":true}],"points":[{"x":0,"y":1,"color":"red"}],"params":{"b":{"min":2,"max":3,"value":2,"label":"底數 b"}},"readout":"在 0 的斜率 = {ln(b)}","height":240},"vals":{"b":2.71828}}},{"do":"write","line":"在 0 的斜率 = 1","on":"的斜"}],"t":[104940,114320]},{"show":["$\\frac{d}{dx}e^x=e^x$"],"say":"所以 e 的 x 次方，導數就是它自己。斜率永遠等於高度。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx2:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}e^x=e^x}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx2","color":"red","on":"次方"},{"do":"write","line":"　1.10 的 $\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{e^h-1}{h}=1$ 說的正是 $k_e=1$","color":"violet","on":"斜率"}],"t":[114320,121880]}]},{"title":"例題","beats":[{"show":["$f(x)=3e^x-x^2$，求 $f'(x)$ 與 $f'(0)$"],"say":"例題：3 e 的 x 次方減 x 平方，求導數，以及在 0 的值。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$f(x)=3e^x-x^2$，求 $f'(x)$ 與 $f'(0)$"}],"t":[121880,130140]},{"show":["線性，一項一項微：","$f'(x)=3e^x-2x$"],"say":"線性照用：3 倍 e 的 x 次方，微完還是 3 倍 e 的 x 次方；x 平方用冪次法則，變 2x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"線性，一項一項微："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle f'(x)=3e^x-2x$","on":"次方#2"}],"t":[130140,140740]},{"show":["$f'(0)=3e^0-0=3$"],"say":"代 0：e 的 0 次方是 1，所以是 3。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx3:\\displaystyle f'(0)=3e^0-0=3}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx3","color":"red","on":"方是"}],"t":[140740,146240]},{"show":["切線過原點：$y=e^x$ 在 $x=1$"],"say":"再一題：e 的 x 次方在 x 等於 1 的切線。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"切線過原點：$y=e^x$ 在 $x=1$"}],"t":[146240,153030]},{"show":["切點 $(1,e)$，斜率 $e^1=e$","$y-e=e(x-1)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=ex$"],"say":"切點是 1 逗號 e，斜率也是 e。點斜式整理，常數項剛好消掉：y 等於 e 乘 x。這條切線通過原點。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"切點 $(1,e)$，斜率 $e^1=e$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx4:\\displaystyle y-e=e(x-1)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=ex}}$","color":"red","on":"點斜"},{"do":"box","term":"bx4","color":"red","on":"等於"}],"t":[153030,164710]},{"show":["在 x = 1 的切線剛好通過原點"],"say":"圖上，紅色切線從原點出發，剛好在 1 逗號 e 碰到曲線。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"tl","window":[-2,2.2,-1,7],"fn":[{"expr":"e^x","color":"blue","label":"y = eˣ"},{"expr":"e*x","color":"red","dash":true,"label":"y = ex"}],"points":[{"x":1,"y":"e","label":"(1, e)","color":"red"},{"x":0,"y":0,"color":"red"}],"height":220}}},{"do":"write","line":"在 x = 1 的切線剛好通過原點","color":"violet","on":"好在"}],"t":[164710,171920]}]},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\big(5e^x+x^3\\big)$ 在 $x=0$ 的值是？"],"say":"試一題。","t":[171920,181020]}],"check":0},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$y=e^x$ 在任何一點 $x=a$ 的切線，跟 $x$ 軸交在哪裡？"],"say":"猜猜看：e 的 x 次方在任何一點的切線，跟 x 軸交在哪？","t":[181020,190580]}],"predict":{"ask":"$y=e^x$ 在任何一點 $x=a$ 的切線，跟 $x$ 軸交在哪裡？","options":[{"label":"$x=a-1$","correct":true},{"label":"$x=0$","why":"只有 $a=1$ 時才是原點"},{"label":"$x=a+1$","why":"曲線往右上升，切線要往左才碰到 $x$ 軸"},{"label":"不一定，要看 $a$","why":"斜率跟高度一樣，所以永遠往左走 $1$ 就到 $0$"}]}},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["斜率 = 高度：往左走 1 單位，高度剛好降到 $0$"],"say":"因為斜率等於高度，從切點往左走 1 單位，就剛好降了一整個高度，碰到 x 軸。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"斜率 = 高度：往左走 1 單位，高度剛好降到 $0$"}],"t":[190580,199480]}]},{"title":"一般底數","beats":[{"show":["要算 $k_a=\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$"],"say":"一般的底數呢？我們要算出 k a 的精確值。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"要算 $k_a=\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}$"}],"t":[199480,206220]},{"show":["1.10 的標準極限：","$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}=\\ln a$"],"say":"1.10 已經算過：這個極限是自然對數 a。證明在這一課最後。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"1.10 的標準極限："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx5:\\displaystyle \\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}=\\ln a}}$","on":"這個"},{"do":"box","term":"bx5","on":"證明"}],"t":[206220,213840]},{"show":["$\\frac{d}{dx}a^x=a^x\\ln a$"],"say":"所以 a 的 x 次方的導數，是 a 的 x 次方乘自然對數 a。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx6:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}a^x=a^x\\ln a}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx6","color":"red","on":"的導"},{"do":"write","line":"　$a=e$：$\\ln e=1$，回到 $(e^x)'=e^x$","color":"violet","on":"次方#2"}],"t":[213840,221540]},{"show":["例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}2^x=2^x\\ln2$"],"say":"例如底數 2：2 的 x 次方，導數是 2 的 x 次方乘自然對數 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}2^x=2^x\\ln2$"}],"t":[221540,230290]},{"show":["在 $x=3$：","$2^3\\ln2=8\\ln2\\approx5.545$"],"say":"在 x 等於 3：2 的 3 次方是 8，乘自然對數 2，大約 5.545。跟剛才圖上看到的一樣。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"在 $x=3$："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx7:\\displaystyle 2^3\\ln2=8\\ln2\\approx5.545}}$","color":"red","on":"方是"},{"do":"box","term":"bx7","color":"red","on":"54"}],"t":[230290,240490]},{"show":["$0<a<1$：$\\ln a<0$，斜率是負的"],"say":"如果底數在 0 和 1 之間，自然對數 a 是負的，所以斜率是負的：函數一路往下降。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$0<a<1$：$\\ln a<0$，斜率是負的"},{"do":"write","line":"　例：$\\big((\\frac12)^x\\big)'=(\\frac12)^x\\ln\\frac12=-(\\frac12)^x\\ln2$","color":"violet","on":"是負#1"}],"t":[240490,249990]}]},{"title":"$a^x$ 不是 $x^a$","beats":[{"show":["$\\def\\arraystretch{1.4}\\begin{array}{l|l|l}&\\text{變數在}&\\text{導數}\\\\\\hline x^a\\ \\text{冪次}&\\text{底數}&ax^{a-1}\\\\ a^x\\ \\text{指數}&\\text{指數}&a^x\\ln a\\end{array}$"],"say":"最容易搞混的是：x 的 a 次方，和 a 的 x 次方。先看變數在哪裡：在底數，是冪次函數，用冪次法則；在指數，是指數函數，用今天的公式。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx8:\\displaystyle \\def\\arraystretch{1.4}{\\begin{array}{l|l|l}&\\text{變數在}&\\text{導數}\\\\\\hline x^a\\ \\text{冪次}&\\text{底數}&ax^{a-1}\\\\ a^x\\ \\text{指數}&\\text{指數}&a^x\\ln a\\end{array}}}}$"},{"do":"box","term":"bx8","on":"在底"}],"t":[249990,266530]},{"show":["例：$x^2$ vs $2^x$","$(x^2)'=2x,\\qquad(2^x)'=2^x\\ln2$"],"say":"例如 x 平方，導數是 2x；2 的 x 次方，導數是 2 的 x 次方乘自然對數 2。完全不一樣。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$x^2$ vs $2^x$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle (x^2)'=2x,\\qquad(2^x)'=2^x\\ln2$","on":"數是#2"}],"t":[266530,277630]},{"show":["常見錯誤：$(2^x)'\\ne x\\cdot2^{x-1}$"],"say":"常見的錯誤，是把冪次法則用在指數函數上，寫成 x 乘 2 的 x 減 1 次方。這是錯的：冪次法則只管次方是常數的情形。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"常見錯誤：$(2^x)'\\ne x\\cdot2^{x-1}$","color":"red"}],"t":[277630,290220]}],"check":1},{"title":"證明 $\\frac{a^h-1}{h}\\to\\ln a$","beats":[{"show":["$a=1$：$\\frac{1-1}{h}=0=\\ln1$，成立。設 $a\\ne1$"],"say":"最後證明這個極限。a 等於 1 時，兩邊都是 0，沒問題。以下設 a 不等於 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$a=1$：$\\frac{1-1}{h}=0=\\ln1$，成立。設 $a\\ne1$"}],"t":[299410,309020]},{"show":["換成 $e$：$a^h=e^{h\\ln a}$"],"say":"把底數換成 e：a 的 h 次方，等於 e 的 h 乘自然對數 a 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"換成 $e$：$a^h=e^{h\\ln a}$"}],"t":[309020,317970]},{"show":["令 $t=h\\ln a$：","$\\frac{a^h-1}{h}=\\frac{e^{t}-1}{t}\\cdot\\ln a$"],"say":"令 t 等於 h 乘自然對數 a，所以 h 等於 t 除以自然對數 a。代進去，整個變成 e 的 t 次方減 1 除以 t，再乘自然對數 a。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"令 $t=h\\ln a$："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{a^h-1}{h}=\\frac{e^{t}-1}{t}\\cdot\\ln a$","on":"除以#1"},{"do":"write","line":"　$\\ln a\\ne0$，所以可以除；$h\\ne0$ 時 $t\\ne0$","color":"violet","on":"次方"}],"t":[317970,335080]},{"show":["$h\\to0$ 時 $t\\to0$，用 1.10：$\\dfrac{e^t-1}{t}\\to1$","$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}=1\\cdot\\ln a=\\ln a\\qquad\\blacksquare$"],"say":"h 趨近 0，t 也趨近 0。1.10 的標準極限說 e 的 t 次方減 1 除以 t 趨近 1，所以整個趨近自然對數 a。證明完畢。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$h\\to0$ 時 $t\\to0$，用 1.10：$\\dfrac{e^t-1}{t}\\to1$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx9:\\displaystyle \\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{a^h-1}{h}=1\\cdot\\ln a=\\ln a\\qquad\\blacksquare}}$","color":"red","on":"準極"},{"do":"box","term":"bx9","color":"red","on":"趨近#3"}],"t":[335080,348880]},{"show":["合起來：$(a^x)'=a^x\\cdot k_a=a^x\\ln a$"],"say":"把它放回第一節的式子：導數是 a 的 x 次方乘 k a，k a 就是自然對數 a。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"合起來：$(a^x)'=a^x\\cdot k_a=a^x\\ln a$"},{"do":"write","line":"　再往回追：$\\frac{e^t-1}{t}\\to1$ 是從 $\\frac{\\ln(1+x)}{x}\\to1$ 推出來的（1.10）","color":"violet","on":"次方"}],"t":[348880,366000]}]},{"title":"重點整理","beats":[{"show":["• $(a^x)'=a^x\\cdot k_a$：斜率 跟高度成正比","• $e$：讓 $k=1$ 的底數，$(e^x)'=e^x$"],"say":"整理一下：指數函數的斜率跟高度成正比；e 是讓比例剛好是 1 的底數；一般底數多乘一個自然對數 a；先看變數在底數還是指數，再選公式。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• $(a^x)'=a^x\\cdot k_a$：斜率 跟高度成正比"},{"do":"write","line":"• $e$：讓 $k=1$ 的底數，$(e^x)'=e^x$","on":"高度"},{"do":"write","line":"• 一般底數：$(a^x)'=a^x\\ln a$","on":"好是"},{"do":"write","line":"• 變數在指數 → 指數公式；變數在底數 → 冪次法則","on":"乘一"},{"do":"write","line":"• 證明：$a^h=e^{h\\ln a}$，用 $\\frac{e^t-1}{t}\\to1$","on":"數在"}],"t":[366000,379800]},{"show":["下一課：對數函數微分"],"say":"下一課，學對數函數的導數。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"下一課：對數函數微分"}],"t":[379800,385437]}]}],"checks":[{"ask":"$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\big(5e^x+x^3\\big)$ 在 $x=0$ 的值是？","options":[{"label":"$5$","correct":true},{"label":"$5e$","why":"$e^0=1$，不是 $e$"},{"label":"$0$","why":"$e^x$ 的導數不是 $0$；$e^x$ 不是常數"},{"label":"$8$","why":"$3x^2$ 在 $0$ 是 $0$，不是 $3$"}]},{"ask":"$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\big(x^e+e^x\\big)=$？","options":[{"label":"$ex^{e-1}+e^x$","correct":true},{"label":"$ex^{e-1}+xe^{x-1}$","why":"$e^x$ 的變數在指數，不能用冪次法則"},{"label":"$x^e+e^x$","why":"只有 $e^x$ 微完不變；$x^e$ 要用冪次法則"},{"label":"$x^e\\ln x+e^x$","why":"把 $x^e$ 當成指數函數了：它的底數才是變數"}]}],"practice":[{"id":"lec-03-m5","core":true},{"id":"gx-032","core":true},{"id":"gi-103","core":true},{"id":"cg-2b-007","core":true},{"id":"cg-2b-010","core":true},{"id":"cg-2b-012","core":true},{"id":"cg-2b-009"},{"id":"cg-2b-008"},{"id":"cg-2b-011"},{"id":"cg-2b-013"},{"id":"db-def-004","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：拆成 $\\frac{e^{3h} - 1}{h} - \\frac{e^{-2h} - 1}{h}$，各自用標準極限。"}]},"derivative-log":{"id":"derivative-log","prerequisites":["derivative-exp","exp-log","inverse-function","limit-exp-log-standard"],"next":["product-rule"],"related":["inverse-trig-derivative","chain-rule","logarithmic-differentiation"],"objectives":["用 $(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x$ 與 $(\\log_a x)'=\\frac{1}{x\\ln a}$ 微分並求切線","先用對數律把 $\\ln(x^3)$、$\\ln(5x)$、$\\log_2(x^3)$ 拆開再微分","知道 $(\\ln|x|)'=\\frac1x$ 對所有 $x\\ne0$ 成立","用定義與標準極限證明 $(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x$ 與 $(\\ln|x|)'=\\frac1x$"],"concept":[{"heading":"① 鏡子裡的斜率","body":["$y=\\ln x$ 是 $y=e^x$ 對 $y=x$ 的鏡射","鏡射：$x$、$y$ 對調 → 斜率變倒數","藍點斜率 $e^a$ → 紅點斜率 $\\dfrac{1}{e^a}$","紅點的 $x$ 座標就是 $e^a$：","這是直覺，不是證明；嚴格的證明在 ⑤"],"tex":["\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln x=\\frac1x"]},{"heading":"② 公式","body":["一般底數：換底公式","$\\frac{1}{\\ln a}$ 是常數，提出來：","例：$(\\log_{10}x)'=\\frac{1}{x\\ln10}$；$a=e$ 時 $\\ln e=1$，回到 $\\frac1x$","切線的 $y$ 截距：$y=\\ln x$ 在 $x=e^2$","切點：$\\ln e^2=2$，點 $(e^2,2)$；斜率 $\\dfrac1{e^2}$","$y$ 截距 $=1$","一般：在 $x=c$ 的切線，$y$ 截距 $=\\ln c-1$"],"tex":["(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x\\quad(x>0)","\\log_ax=\\frac{\\ln x}{\\ln a}","(\\log_ax)'=\\frac{1}{x\\ln a}","y-2=\\frac{1}{e^2}(x-e^2)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\frac{x}{e^2}+1"]},{"heading":"② 試一題","body":["$\\ln x$ 一直上升，但越來越平"]},{"heading":"③ 先拆再微","body":["對數律：","例：$\\ln(x^3)=3\\ln x$（$x>0$）","例：$\\ln(5x)=\\ln5+\\ln x$","$\\ln(5x)$ 跟 $\\ln x$ 只差常數 $\\ln5$：圖形上下平移，斜率一樣","例：$y=\\log_2(x^3)$（$x>0$）"],"tex":["\\begin{aligned}\\ln(AB)&=\\ln A+\\ln B\\\\\\ln(A^r)&=r\\ln A\\end{aligned}","\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln(x^3)=\\frac3x","\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln(5x)=0+\\frac1x=\\frac1x","y=3\\log_2x\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y'=\\frac{3}{x\\ln2}"]},{"heading":"④ $\\ln|x|$：負數那一半","body":["$\\ln x$ 只在 $x>0$ 有定義；$\\ln|x|$ 在所有 $x\\ne0$ 都有","對 $y$ 軸鏡射：斜率變號","$x=2$ 斜率 $\\frac12$ → $x=-2$ 斜率 $-\\frac12=\\dfrac{1}{-2}$","分母是 $x$，不是 $|x|$：$x<0$ 時斜率是負的"],"tex":["\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln|x|=\\frac1x\\quad(x\\ne0)"]},{"heading":"⑤ 證明 $(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x$","body":["$x>0$，用定義與對數律：","令 $t=\\dfrac hx$，則 $\\dfrac1h=\\dfrac1x\\cdot\\dfrac1t$：","$h\\to0$ 時 $t\\to0$；1.10：$\\dfrac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}\\to1$","$x<0$：$h$ 很小時 $x+h$ 也是負的","後面完全一樣：$(\\ln|x|)'=\\dfrac1x$　$\\blacksquare$"],"tex":["\\frac{\\ln(x+h)-\\ln x}{h}=\\frac1h\\ln\\frac{x+h}{x}=\\frac1h\\ln\\Big(1+\\frac hx\\Big)","=\\frac1x\\cdot\\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}","(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x\\cdot1=\\frac1x\\qquad\\blacksquare","\\frac{|x+h|}{|x|}=\\frac{-(x+h)}{-x}=1+\\frac hx"]},{"heading":"重點整理","body":["• 直覺：$\\ln$ 是 $e^x$ 的鏡射，斜率變倒數","• $(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x$，$(\\log_ax)'=\\frac{1}{x\\ln a}$","• 對數裡有乘積、次方：先拆再微","• $(\\ln|x|)'=\\frac1x$，所有 $x\\ne0$","• 證明：$\\ln\\frac{x+h}{x}=\\ln(1+\\frac hx)$，用 $\\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}\\to1$","下一課：乘法法則"]}],"workedExamples":[{"title":"切線的 $y$ 截距","prompt":"$y = \\ln x$ 在 $x = e^2$ 的切線，$y$ 截距是多少？","problemId":"db-tan-003","steps":["斜率：$\\frac{1}{x}$ 在 $x = e^2$ 是 $\\frac{1}{e^2}$。","切點：$\\ln(e^2) = 2$，切點是 $(e^2, 2)$。","切線：$y - 2 = \\left(\\frac{1}{e^2}\\right)(x - e^2) = \\frac{x}{e^2} - 1$，所以 $y = \\frac{x}{e^2} + 1$。","令 $x = 0$，$y$ 截距是 1。"],"answer":"1"},{"title":"先用對數律","prompt":"$y = \\log_2(x^3)$（$x > 0$），求 $y'$。","problemId":"lec-03-q2d","steps":["對數律：$\\log_2(x^3) = 3 \\log_2 x$。","$(\\log_2 x)' = \\frac{1}{x \\ln 2}$。","$y' = \\frac{3}{x \\ln 2}$。"],"answer":"$\\frac{3}{x \\ln 2}$"},{"title":"$\\ln|x|$ 在負數","prompt":"$y = \\ln|x|$，求 $x = -2$ 處的切線斜率。","steps":["$x \\ne 0$ 時 $(\\ln|x|)' = \\frac{1}{x}$。","$x = -2$：$\\frac{1}{-2} = -\\frac{1}{2}$。","合理性：$x < 0$ 那一半是 $\\ln x$ 的左右鏡像，$x$ 往右走時 $|x|$ 變小，函數值下降，斜率應該是負的。"],"answer":"$-\\frac{1}{2}$"}],"pitfalls":["$(\\ln 5)'$ 寫成 $\\frac{1}{5}$。$\\ln 5$ 是常數，導數是 0。","$\\ln(x + 1)$ 拆成 $\\ln x + \\ln 1$。對數不能拆加法。","$(\\log_2 x)'$ 寫成 $\\frac{1}{x}$，漏了 $\\ln 2$。","$(\\ln(5x))'$ 寫成 $\\frac{1}{5x}$，或 $\\frac{5}{x}$：拆成 $\\ln 5 + \\ln x$ 就知道是 $\\frac{1}{x}$。","在 $x \\le 0$ 的地方用 $\\ln x$ 的導數，忘了 $\\ln x$ 只在 $x > 0$ 有定義。"],"voice":"3b0c70a5","sections":[{"title":"鏡子裡的斜率","beats":[{"show":["$y=\\ln x$ 是 $y=e^x$ 對 $y=x$ 的鏡射"],"say":"自然對數是 e 的 x 次方的反函數。0.7 學過，反函數的圖形，就是原來的圖形對 y 等於 x 這條線做鏡射。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$y=\\ln x$ 是 $y=e^x$ 對 $y=x$ 的鏡射"}],"t":[2280,13880]},{"show":["藍：y = eˣ，紅：y = ln x，灰：y = x；藍點 (a, eᵃ) 照鏡子變成紅點 (eᵃ, a)"],"say":"藍點在 e 的 x 次方上，座標 a 逗號 e 的 a 次方。照鏡子，x 和 y 對調，變成紅點，在自然對數的圖上。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"mir","window":[-2,6.5,-1.5,3.6],"equal":true,"fn":[{"expr":"e^x","color":"blue"},{"expr":"ln(x)","color":"red","domain":[0.02,6.5]},{"expr":"x","color":"pencil","dash":true},{"expr":"e^a*(x-a)+e^a","color":"blue","dash":true},{"expr":"(x-e^a)/e^a+a","color":"red","dash":true}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"e^a","color":"blue"},{"x":"e^a","y":"a","color":"red"}],"params":{"a":{"min":-1,"max":1.3,"value":0,"label":"a"}},"readout":"藍切線斜率 = {e^a}，紅切線斜率 = {1/e^a}","height":400}}},{"do":"write","line":"藍切線斜率 = 1，紅切線斜率 = 1","on":"逗號"},{"do":"write","line":"藍：y = eˣ，紅：y = ln x，灰：y = x；藍點 (a, eᵃ) 照鏡子變成紅點 (eᵃ, a)","color":"violet","on":"對調"}],"t":[13880,25880]},{"show":["鏡子裡的斜率"],"say":"切線也跟著鏡射。藍色切線的斜率是 e 的 a 次方；鏡射後，上升和往右對調，紅色切線的斜率變成倒數。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"mir","window":[-2,6.5,-1.5,3.6],"equal":true,"fn":[{"expr":"e^x","color":"blue"},{"expr":"ln(x)","color":"red","domain":[0.02,6.5]},{"expr":"x","color":"pencil","dash":true},{"expr":"e^a*(x-a)+e^a","color":"blue","dash":true},{"expr":"(x-e^a)/e^a+a","color":"red","dash":true}],"points":[{"x":"a","y":"e^a","color":"blue"},{"x":"e^a","y":"a","color":"red"}],"params":{"a":{"min":-1,"max":1.3,"value":0,"label":"a"}},"readout":"藍切線斜率 = {e^a}，紅切線斜率 = {1/e^a}","height":400},"vals":{"a":1.2}}},{"do":"write","line":"藍切線斜率 = 3.32，紅切線斜率 = 0.3012","on":"鏡射#2"}],"t":[25880,37800]},{"show":["鏡射：$x$、$y$ 對調 → 斜率變倒數"],"say":"所以鏡射的規則是：x 和 y 對調，斜率就變成倒數。因為斜率是 y 的變化除以 x 的變化，對調就倒過來。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"鏡射：$x$、$y$ 對調 → 斜率變倒數","color":"gold"}],"t":[37800,48960]},{"show":["藍點斜率 $e^a$ → 紅點斜率 $\\dfrac{1}{e^a}$"],"say":"藍點的斜率是 e 的 a 次方，所以紅點的斜率是 e 的 a 次方分之一。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"藍點斜率 $e^a$ → 紅點斜率 $\\dfrac{1}{e^a}$"}],"t":[48960,58150]},{"show":["紅點的 $x$ 座標就是 $e^a$：","$\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln x=\\frac1x$"],"say":"而紅點的 x 座標，正好就是 e 的 a 次方。所以自然對數在 x 的斜率，就是 x 分之一。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"紅點的 $x$ 座標就是 $e^a$："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx1:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}\\ln x=\\frac1x}}$","color":"red","on":"好就"},{"do":"box","term":"bx1","color":"red","on":"所以"},{"do":"write","line":"　這是直覺，不是證明；嚴格的證明在 ⑤","color":"violet","on":"斜率"}],"t":[58150,68650]}]},{"title":"公式","beats":[{"show":["$(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x\\quad(x>0)$"],"say":"公式一：自然對數 x 的導數是 x 分之一，x 要大於 0。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx2:\\displaystyle (\\ln x)'=\\frac1x\\quad(x>0)}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx2","color":"red","on":"分之"}],"t":[68650,76310]},{"show":["一般底數：換底公式","$\\log_ax=\\frac{\\ln x}{\\ln a}$"],"say":"一般底數的對數，先用換底公式，寫成自然對數 x 除以自然對數 a。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"一般底數：換底公式"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\log_ax=\\frac{\\ln x}{\\ln a}$","on":"成自"}],"t":[76310,84850]},{"show":["$\\frac{1}{\\ln a}$ 是常數，提出來：","$(\\log_ax)'=\\frac{1}{x\\ln a}$"],"say":"自然對數 a 分之一只是一個常數，可以提出來。所以對數 a 為底的導數，是 x 乘自然對數 a 分之一。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\frac{1}{\\ln a}$ 是常數，提出來："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx3:\\displaystyle (\\log_ax)'=\\frac{1}{x\\ln a}}}$","color":"red","on":"個常"},{"do":"box","term":"bx3","color":"red","on":"為底"},{"do":"write","line":"　例：$(\\log_{10}x)'=\\frac{1}{x\\ln10}$；$a=e$ 時 $\\ln e=1$，回到 $\\frac1x$","color":"violet","on":"乘自"}],"t":[84850,96350]},{"show":["切線的 $y$ 截距：$y=\\ln x$ 在 $x=e^2$"],"say":"例題：自然對數在 x 等於 e 平方的切線，y 截距是多少？","board":[{"do":"write","line":"切線的 $y$ 截距：$y=\\ln x$ 在 $x=e^2$"}],"t":[96350,102770]},{"show":["切點：$\\ln e^2=2$，點 $(e^2,2)$；斜率 $\\dfrac1{e^2}$"],"say":"切點的 y 座標是自然對數 e 平方，等於 2。斜率是 e 平方分之一。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"切點：$\\ln e^2=2$，點 $(e^2,2)$；斜率 $\\dfrac1{e^2}$"}],"t":[102770,110490]},{"show":["$y-2=\\frac{1}{e^2}(x-e^2)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\frac{x}{e^2}+1$"],"say":"點斜式：y 減 2 等於 e 平方分之一，乘 x 減 e 平方。乘開，常數項是負 1，加上 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx4:\\displaystyle y-2=\\frac{1}{e^2}(x-e^2)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\frac{x}{e^2}+1}}$"},{"do":"box","term":"bx4","on":"平方#2"}],"t":[110490,120490]},{"show":["$y$ 截距 $=1$"],"say":"整理得 y 等於 e 平方分之 x 加 1，所以 y 截距是 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$y$ 截距 $=1$","color":"red"},{"do":"write","line":"　一般：在 $x=c$ 的切線，$y$ 截距 $=\\ln c-1$","color":"violet","on":"所以"}],"t":[120490,128190]}]},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$y=\\log_3x$ 在 $x=2$ 的切線斜率是？"],"say":"試一題：3 為底的對數，在 2 的斜率。","t":[128190,137720]}],"check":0},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$y=\\ln x$ 的切線斜率，$x$ 越大會？"],"say":"猜猜看：x 越大，自然對數的斜率會怎樣？","t":[137720,146650]}],"predict":{"ask":"$y=\\ln x$ 的切線斜率，$x$ 越大會？","options":[{"label":"越來越小，但一直是正的","correct":true},{"label":"越來越大","why":"那是 $e^x$；鏡射後斜率變倒數"},{"label":"最後變成負的","why":"$x>0$ 時 $\\frac1x$ 永遠是正的：$\\ln x$ 一直在上升"}]}},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$\\ln x$ 一直上升，但越來越平"],"say":"x 分之一永遠是正的，所以自然對數一直在上升；但 x 越大斜率越小，曲線越來越平。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\ln x$ 一直上升，但越來越平"}],"t":[146650,157840]}]},{"title":"先拆再微","beats":[{"show":["對數律：","$\\begin{aligned}\\ln(AB)&=\\ln A+\\ln B\\\\\\ln(A^r)&=r\\ln A\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"遇到對數裡面有乘積或次方，先用對數律拆開，就只剩下今天的公式。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"對數律："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx5:\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\ln(AB)&=\\ln A+\\ln B\\\\\\ln(A^r)&=r\\ln A\\end{aligned}}}}$","on":"次方"},{"do":"box","term":"bx5","on":"就只"}],"t":[157840,167050]},{"show":["例：$\\ln(x^3)=3\\ln x$（$x>0$）","$\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln(x^3)=\\frac3x$"],"say":"例如自然對數 x 的三次方，就是 3 倍自然對數 x，導數是 x 分之 3。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\ln(x^3)=3\\ln x$（$x>0$）"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx6:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}\\ln(x^3)=\\frac3x}}$","color":"red","on":"就是"},{"do":"box","term":"bx6","color":"red","on":"導數"}],"t":[167050,176420]},{"show":["例：$\\ln(5x)=\\ln5+\\ln x$","$\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln(5x)=0+\\frac1x=\\frac1x$"],"say":"自然對數 5x，拆成自然對數 5 加自然對數 x。自然對數 5 是常數，導數 0。所以答案就是 x 分之一。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\ln(5x)=\\ln5+\\ln x$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx7:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}\\ln(5x)=0+\\frac1x=\\frac1x}}$","color":"red","on":"自然#3"},{"do":"box","term":"bx7","color":"red","on":"導數"}],"t":[176420,188930]},{"show":["$\\ln(5x)$ 跟 $\\ln x$ 只差常數 $\\ln5$：圖形上下平移，斜率一樣"],"say":"這很合理：自然對數 5x 和自然對數 x 只差一個常數，圖形只是上下平移，斜率完全一樣。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\ln(5x)$ 跟 $\\ln x$ 只差常數 $\\ln5$：圖形上下平移，斜率一樣"}],"t":[188930,199920]},{"show":["例：$y=\\log_2(x^3)$（$x>0$）","$y=3\\log_2x\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y'=\\frac{3}{x\\ln2}$"],"say":"2 為底的對數 x 三次方，先把 3 拿到前面，變成 3 倍的對數 2 為底 x，導數是 x 乘自然對數 2 分之 3。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$y=\\log_2(x^3)$（$x>0$）"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx8:\\displaystyle y=3\\log_2x\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y'=\\frac{3}{x\\ln2}}}$","color":"red","on":"到前"},{"do":"box","term":"bx8","color":"red","on":"導數"}],"t":[199920,212320]}],"check":1},{"title":"$\\ln|x|$：負數那一半","beats":[{"show":["$\\ln x$ 只在 $x>0$ 有定義；$\\ln|x|$ 在所有 $x\\ne0$ 都有"],"say":"自然對數只在正數有定義。加上絕對值，自然對數絕對值 x，在所有不等於 0 的 x 都有定義。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\ln x$ 只在 $x>0$ 有定義；$\\ln|x|$ 在所有 $x\\ne0$ 都有"}],"t":[221100,231220]},{"show":["藍：y = ln|x|，左右對稱；紅點 (−2, ln 2) 斜率 −1/2，綠點 (2, ln 2) 斜率 1/2"],"say":"圖形左右對稱：右半邊是自然對數，左半邊是它對 y 軸的鏡射。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"abs","window":[-4,4,-2.5,2],"fn":[{"expr":"ln(abs(x))","color":"blue","domain":[-4,-0.05]},{"expr":"ln(abs(x))","color":"blue","domain":[0.05,4]},{"expr":"-(x+2)/2+ln(2)","color":"red","dash":true},{"expr":"(x-2)/2+ln(2)","color":"green","dash":true}],"points":[{"x":-2,"y":"ln(2)","color":"red"},{"x":2,"y":"ln(2)","color":"green"}],"height":250}}},{"do":"write","line":"藍：y = ln|x|，左右對稱；紅點 (−2, ln 2) 斜率 −1/2，綠點 (2, ln 2) 斜率 1/2","color":"violet","on":"左半"}],"t":[231220,239040]},{"show":["對 $y$ 軸鏡射：斜率變號"],"say":"對 y 軸鏡射，左右顛倒，上坡變下坡，所以斜率變號。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"對 $y$ 軸鏡射：斜率變號"}],"t":[239040,245510]},{"show":["$x=2$ 斜率 $\\frac12$ → $x=-2$ 斜率 $-\\frac12=\\dfrac{1}{-2}$"],"say":"在 2 的斜率是 2 分之一；鏡射到負 2，斜率變成負 2 分之一，剛好也是 x 分之一，x 等於負 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x=2$ 斜率 $\\frac12$ → $x=-2$ 斜率 $-\\frac12=\\dfrac{1}{-2}$"}],"t":[245510,256510]},{"show":["$\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln|x|=\\frac1x\\quad(x\\ne0)$"],"say":"所以不管 x 是正是負，自然對數絕對值 x 的導數都是 x 分之一。證明在下一節。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx9:\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dx}\\ln|x|=\\frac1x\\quad(x\\ne0)}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx9","color":"red","on":"然對"},{"do":"write","line":"　分母是 $x$，不是 $|x|$：$x<0$ 時斜率是負的","color":"violet","on":"分之"}],"t":[256510,265460]}],"check":2},{"title":"證明 $(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x$","beats":[{"show":["$x>0$，用定義與對數律：","$\\frac{\\ln(x+h)-\\ln x}{h}=\\frac1h\\ln\\frac{x+h}{x}=\\frac1h\\ln\\Big(1+\\frac hx\\Big)$"],"say":"用定義證明。x 大於 0。分子用對數律，相減變成相除：自然對數 x 加 h 除以 x，也就是 1 加 x 分之 h。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x>0$，用定義與對數律："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{\\ln(x+h)-\\ln x}{h}=\\frac1h\\ln\\frac{x+h}{x}=\\frac1h\\ln\\Big(1+\\frac hx\\Big)$","on":"對數#2"}],"t":[276000,289600]},{"show":["令 $t=\\dfrac hx$，則 $\\dfrac1h=\\dfrac1x\\cdot\\dfrac1t$：","$=\\frac1x\\cdot\\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}$"],"say":"令 t 等於 x 分之 h。h 分之一可以寫成 x 分之一乘 t 分之一，整個變成 x 分之一，乘上自然對數 1 加 t 除以 t。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"令 $t=\\dfrac hx$，則 $\\dfrac1h=\\dfrac1x\\cdot\\dfrac1t$："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle =\\frac1x\\cdot\\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}$","on":"分之#4"}],"t":[289600,305700]},{"show":["$h\\to0$ 時 $t\\to0$；1.10：$\\dfrac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}\\to1$","$(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x\\cdot1=\\frac1x\\qquad\\blacksquare$"],"say":"h 趨近 0，t 也趨近 0。1.10 的標準極限說，自然對數 1 加 t 除以 t 趨近 1。所以導數是 x 分之一。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$h\\to0$ 時 $t\\to0$；1.10：$\\dfrac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}\\to1$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx10:\\displaystyle (\\ln x)'=\\frac1x\\cdot1=\\frac1x\\qquad\\blacksquare}}$","color":"red","on":"的標"},{"do":"box","term":"bx10","color":"red","on":"趨近#3"}],"t":[305700,319740]},{"show":["$x<0$：$h$ 很小時 $x+h$ 也是負的","$\\frac{|x+h|}{|x|}=\\frac{-(x+h)}{-x}=1+\\frac hx$"],"say":"x 是負的時候，h 夠小，x 加 h 也是負的。兩個絕對值相除，負號抵消，還是 1 加 x 分之 h。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x<0$：$h$ 很小時 $x+h$ 也是負的"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\frac{|x+h|}{|x|}=\\frac{-(x+h)}{-x}=1+\\frac hx$","on":"個絕"}],"t":[319740,330400]},{"show":["後面完全一樣：$(\\ln|x|)'=\\dfrac1x$　$\\blacksquare$"],"say":"接下來的步驟一模一樣，所以自然對數絕對值 x 的導數也是 x 分之一。證明完畢。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"後面完全一樣：$(\\ln|x|)'=\\dfrac1x$　$\\blacksquare$","color":"red"}],"t":[330400,346940]}]},{"title":"重點整理","beats":[{"show":["• 直覺：$\\ln$ 是 $e^x$ 的鏡射，斜率變倒數","• $(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x$，$(\\log_ax)'=\\frac{1}{x\\ln a}$"],"say":"整理一下：自然對數是 e 的 x 次方的鏡射，斜率變倒數；一般底數多除一個自然對數 a；有乘積或次方，先拆再微；加上絕對值，負數也適用。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• 直覺：$\\ln$ 是 $e^x$ 的鏡射，斜率變倒數"},{"do":"write","line":"• $(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x$，$(\\log_ax)'=\\frac{1}{x\\ln a}$","on":"次方#1"},{"do":"write","line":"• 對數裡有乘積、次方：先拆再微","on":"一般"},{"do":"write","line":"• $(\\ln|x|)'=\\frac1x$，所有 $x\\ne0$","on":"有乘"},{"do":"write","line":"• 證明：$\\ln\\frac{x+h}{x}=\\ln(1+\\frac hx)$，用 $\\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}\\to1$","on":"加上"}],"t":[346940,361040]},{"show":["下一課：乘法法則"],"say":"下一課，學乘法法則。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"下一課：乘法法則"}],"t":[361040,366237]}]}],"checks":[{"ask":"$y=\\log_3x$ 在 $x=2$ 的切線斜率是？","options":[{"label":"$\\dfrac{1}{2\\ln3}$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\dfrac12$","why":"那是 $\\ln x$ 的；底數 $3$ 還要除以 $\\ln3$"},{"label":"$\\dfrac{\\ln3}{2}$","why":"$\\ln3$ 應該在分母：$\\log_3x=\\frac{\\ln x}{\\ln3}$"},{"label":"$\\dfrac{1}{3\\ln2}$","why":"$x$ 和底數 $a$ 對調了"}]},{"ask":"$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\ln\\sqrt x=$？（$x>0$）","options":[{"label":"$\\dfrac{1}{2x}$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt x}$","why":"不能直接把 $\\sqrt x$ 當成 $x$ 套 $\\frac1x$"},{"label":"$\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt x}$","why":"那是 $\\sqrt x$ 的導數，不是 $\\ln\\sqrt x$ 的"},{"label":"$\\dfrac{2}{x}$","why":"$\\sqrt x=x^{1/2}$，提出來的是 $\\frac12$，不是 $2$"}]},{"ask":"$y=\\ln|x|$ 在 $x=-2$ 的切線斜率是？","options":[{"label":"$-\\dfrac12$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\dfrac12$","why":"把公式記成 $\\frac1{|x|}$ 了；左半邊是下坡"},{"label":"$\\ln2$","why":"這是函數值 $\\ln|-2|$，不是斜率"},{"label":"不存在","why":"$\\ln|x|$ 在 $x=-2$ 有定義，也可以微分"}]}],"practice":[{"id":"rel-basic-011","core":true},{"id":"db-tan-003","core":true},{"id":"lec-03-q2d","core":true},{"id":"dd-def-005","core":true},{"id":"ch-trap-002","core":true,"note":"$\\ln$ 和 $e$ 互相抵消，先化簡就不用連鎖律。"},{"id":"cg-2b-014","core":true},{"id":"lx-der-003"},{"id":"db-def-006"},{"id":"cg-2b-015"},{"id":"cg-2b-016"},{"id":"cg-2b-018"},{"id":"cg-2b-017"},{"id":"cg-2b-019"}]}});
